window.APP_PRIVACY_SOURCE={"beauty-folder":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"BeautyFolder（酷彩文件夹）隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder 是一款 macOS 文件夹图标美化工具。本政策说明应用在您使用文件夹图标、自定义图片、颜色设置、邮件反馈、社区二维码和评分功能时如何处理信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"简要说明： 文件夹和图片处理都在您的 Mac 本地完成。应用不要求注册，也不会把所选文件夹路径、文件夹内容或导入图片上传给开发者。应用仅将您自定义的颜色值和评分提示版本标记保存在本机偏好设置中。"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 应用会处理哪些信息"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder 不要求您创建账户或登录，也没有开发者运营的用户数据服务器。为实现文件夹图标功能，应用会在本机临时处理您主动拖入或通过 macOS 文件选择器选中的文件夹 URL、路径及目录状态，并读取或更新该文件夹的 Finder 图标资源和相关元数据。"},{"type":"p","text":"如果您选择导入自定义图片，应用会在本机读取该图片并用于生成文件夹图标。图片不会上传，原始图片也不会被应用修改。应用不会递归扫描所选文件夹，不会读取其中其他文档或文件的内容，也不会把所选路径或图片发送给开发者。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 文件夹图标操作与文件权限"},{"type":"p","text":"应用使用 macOS App Sandbox。它仅在您拖入文件夹或通过系统文件选择器授权后访问相应项目，并在相关操作期间使用系统提供的受限访问权限；应用不会保存持久化的文件夹访问书签。"},{"type":"p","text":"设置或还原图标需要修改目标文件夹自身的 Finder 图标资源和 Finder 元数据。为使 Finder 刷新显示，应用还可能更新该文件夹的修改时间，并在目录内短暂创建后删除一个刷新标记文件。这些操作针对您选中的文件夹；应用不会有意读取、修改或删除该文件夹内其他文件的内容。系统权限、文件所有权和存储设备状态仍可能影响操作结果。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 本机保存的设置"},{"type":"p","text":"如果您自定义颜色，应用会通过 macOS 的应用偏好设置在本机保存颜色的十六进制值，以便下次使用时恢复颜色选择。应用也会在本机保存一个评分提示版本标记，用于避免同一版本重复请求显示系统评分提示。应用不会将这些设置同步到云端或发送给开发者；所选文件夹路径和导入图片不会作为应用历史记录持久保存。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 日志与诊断信息"},{"type":"p","text":"应用不会向开发者发送使用分析、崩溃报告或诊断日志。不过，在图标操作失败等情况下，应用生成的本机系统日志可能包含相关文件夹路径或错误信息。这些日志由 macOS 在您的设备上管理，BeautyFolder 不会上传它们。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 邮件、社区二维码与 Apple 服务"},{"type":"li","text":"邮件反馈： 当您选择发送反馈时，应用会打开您 Mac 上可用的邮件服务，并预填反馈收件人和邮件主题。只有您在邮件服务中发送后，开发者才会收到您提供的邮箱地址、邮件内容及您选择添加的附件，以答复和处理反馈。应用不会自动附加所选文件夹、图片或诊断日志。邮件服务提供商也会按照其隐私规则处理邮件。"},{"type":"li","text":"QQ 社群二维码： 应用设置页面展示一个可选的 QQ 群二维码。扫描并加入社群是您主动进行的应用外操作；腾讯/QQ 可能根据其隐私规则处理您的账号信息及社群互动信息。"},{"type":"li","text":"评分与 App Store： 成功应用图标后，应用可能调用 Apple StoreKit 请求显示系统评分提示；Apple 决定是否展示提示并处理相应的 App Store 互动。您也可以主动选择评分入口，届时会打开 Mac App Store。Apple 服务适用 Apple 自己的 隐私政策 。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 网络与第三方组件"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder 的文件夹美化功能可离线使用。应用本身没有账户、云同步、广告、跟踪或分析功能，也没有用于收集个人信息的第三方 SDK。发送邮件、扫描 QQ 社群二维码或打开 Apple 评分入口时，相关信息由您选择使用的外部服务处理。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 信息保留与您的选择"},{"type":"p","text":"文件夹路径和导入图片只为当前操作在本机临时处理。自定义颜色值和评分提示版本标记保留在本机应用偏好设置中，直到您修改或清除本机应用数据。应用没有可供开发者查询的云端账户或文件副本。您可以通过应用修改自定义颜色。如果您主动发送邮件，开发者会为答复和处理反馈保留所收到的信息，并在不再需要处理该请求或履行适用法律义务后删除；您可以通过邮件联系我们，申请查阅、更正或删除我们收到的信息。您的邮件服务提供商可能根据其规则保留另一份副本。"},{"type":"h2","text":"8. 儿童隐私"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder 是面向一般用户的 macOS 工具，不以 13 岁以下儿童为目标用户。应用没有账户功能，也不会有意收集儿童的个人信息。"},{"type":"h2","text":"9. 政策更新"},{"type":"p","text":"如果应用功能或信息处理方式发生变化，我们会更新本政策并在此页面公布新的生效日期。"},{"type":"h2","text":"10. 联系我们"},{"type":"p","text":"如对本隐私政策或个人信息处理有疑问，请联系："},{"type":"p","text":"电子邮件： zipmaster_support@126.com"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"BeautyFolder Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder is a macOS utility for customizing Finder folder icons. This policy explains how the App handles information when you use folder styling, custom images, color settings, email feedback, the community QR code, and rating features."},{"type":"p","text":"In brief: Folder and image processing takes place on your Mac. The App does not require an account and does not upload selected folder paths, folder contents, or imported images to the developer. It stores only your custom color values and a review-prompt version marker in local app preferences."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Information the App Processes"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder does not require an account or sign-in and has no developer-operated user-data server. To provide its folder-icon features, the App temporarily processes the URLs, paths, and directory status of folders that you choose by dragging them into the App or selecting them in the macOS file picker. It reads or updates Finder icon resources and related metadata for those folders."},{"type":"p","text":"If you choose to import a custom image, the App reads that image locally to create a folder icon. The image is not uploaded, and the original image is not modified. The App does not recursively scan selected folders, read the contents of other documents or files within them, or send selected paths or images to the developer."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Folder Operations and File Access"},{"type":"p","text":"The App uses the macOS App Sandbox. It accesses only items that you drag into the App or authorize through the system file picker, using the access granted by macOS for the relevant operation. The App does not save persistent folder-access bookmarks."},{"type":"p","text":"Applying or restoring an icon requires changing the selected folder's own Finder icon resource and Finder metadata. To help Finder refresh its display, the App may also update the folder's modification date and briefly create and remove a refresh marker file inside that directory. These operations target the folder you selected; the App does not intentionally read, modify, or delete the contents of other files in that folder. System permissions, file ownership, and storage conditions may affect the result."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Local Settings"},{"type":"p","text":"If you customize colors, the App stores their hexadecimal values in macOS app preferences on your Mac so that your color choices are available later. The App also stores a local review-prompt version marker to avoid requesting the system review prompt more than once for the same version. These settings are not synced to the cloud or sent to the developer. Selected folder paths and imported images are not persistently saved as App history."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Logs and Diagnostics"},{"type":"p","text":"The App does not send usage analytics, crash reports, or diagnostic logs to the developer. However, local system log entries generated during errors, such as a failed icon operation, may include the relevant folder path or error details. macOS manages these logs on your device, and BeautyFolder does not upload them."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Email, Community QR Code, and Apple Services"},{"type":"li","text":"Email feedback: If you choose to send feedback, the App opens an available mail service on your Mac and pre-fills the feedback recipient and a subject line. The developer receives your email address, message, and any attachments you choose to send only after you send the email, and uses them to respond to and handle your feedback. The App does not automatically attach selected folders, images, or diagnostic logs. Your email provider also handles the message under its own privacy practices."},{"type":"li","text":"QQ community QR code: The App displays an optional QR code for a QQ group. Scanning it and joining the group are actions you take outside the App. Tencent/QQ may process your account and community-interaction information under its own privacy practices."},{"type":"li","text":"Ratings and the App Store: After a successful icon application, the App may ask Apple StoreKit to display the system review prompt. Apple decides whether to show the prompt and handles the related App Store interaction. You may also choose the rating link, which opens the Mac App Store. Apple services are subject to Apple's own Privacy Policy ."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Network and Third-Party Components"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder's folder-styling features work offline. The App has no account, cloud-sync, advertising, tracking, or analytics features, and it does not include a third-party SDK for collecting personal information. When you send email, scan the QQ community QR code, or open an Apple rating destination, the external service you choose handles the information involved."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Retention and Your Choices"},{"type":"p","text":"Folder paths and imported images are processed locally for the current operation. Custom color values and the review-prompt version marker remain in local app preferences until you change them or clear local App data. The App has no cloud account or file copy that the developer can look up. You can change custom colors in the App. If you send an email, the developer retains the information received to respond to and handle your feedback, then deletes it when it is no longer needed for that request or applicable legal obligations. You may email us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of information we received. Your email provider may retain a separate copy under its own practices."},{"type":"h2","text":"8. Children's Privacy"},{"type":"p","text":"BeautyFolder is a general-purpose macOS utility and is not directed to children under 13. The App has no account feature and does not knowingly collect personal information from children."},{"type":"h2","text":"9. Changes to This Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"If the App's features or data practices change, we will update this policy and publish the new effective date on this page."},{"type":"h2","text":"10. Contact"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have questions about this policy or the handling of personal information, contact:"},{"type":"p","text":"Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"}]},"caffeineai":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI · 隐私政策"},{"type":"h1","text":"CaffeineAI 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"更新日期：2026年10月13日"},{"type":"h2","text":"本机数据的使用"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI 不创建账户、不显示广告、不使用分析工具，也不会向开发者服务器发送数据。"},{"type":"p","text":"只有启用的规则需要某项信号时，CaffeineAI 才会在这台 Mac 上读取相关信息：当前前台或正在运行的应用标识、CPU 与网络流量计数、已挂载卷名称、网络隧道接口状态、音频设备是否正在使用、已连接蓝牙设备名称、所选 Wi-Fi 网络名称，以及当前是否有日历事件。电量和热状态也仅在本机用于安全规则。这些信息只用于判断规则是否匹配，不会上传。CaffeineAI 不读取位置坐标。日历规则只检查事件是否正在发生，不保存标题或详情。"},{"type":"h2","text":"权限与控制"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS 通过定位服务权限控制 Wi-Fi 网络名称的读取，因此 Wi-Fi 名称规则需要定位权限。日历规则需要日历访问权限。启用蓝牙规则后，应用只在规则运行时读取已连接设备名称。你可以随时在 CaffeineAI 中关闭规则，或在“系统设置”中撤销相应权限。权限被拒绝或信号不可用时，不会被视为规则匹配。"},{"type":"h2","text":"本机保存的信息"},{"type":"p","text":"偏好设置和规则保存在 CaffeineAI 的应用容器中。启用历史记录后，CaffeineAI 最多在本机保留 2,000 条事件，最长七天。事件可能包含时间、类别、详情及规则或会话标识；前台应用变更事件会包含该应用的名称和 Bundle ID。诊断页在内存中显示最近 100 条事件，并在应用退出时清除。启用磁盘保活后，CaffeineAI 会保存你所选文件的路径和安全书签，并按所选间隔读取一个字节；不会修改文件。应用重启后不会恢复活动会话或电源断言标识。"},{"type":"h2","text":"保留与删除"},{"type":"p","text":"决策历史在七天后过期；你可以在“自动化”设置中关闭或清除历史。诊断记录在应用退出时清除。在“关于”中使用“重置设置”可删除已保存的偏好和规则。关闭磁盘保活或移除所选文件可删除对应书签。导出的文件保存在你选择的位置，可在那里自行删除。"},{"type":"h2","text":"导出"},{"type":"p","text":"配置导出包含设置和规则，但不包含所选文件路径、安全书签或活动会话。只有在你选择“保存”并指定位置后，诊断文本才会导出。CaffeineAI 不会传输导出的文件。"},{"type":"h2","text":"数据共享与联系"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI 不含第三方分析或广告 SDK，也不会向开发者服务或其他第三方共享信息。如有隐私问题，请通过 CaffeineAI App Store 产品页面上的支持联系方式联系开发者。"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"CaffeineAI Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Last updated: October 13, 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"Data used on this Mac"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI does not create accounts, show ads, use analytics, or send data to a developer server."},{"type":"p","text":"Only when an enabled rule needs a signal, CaffeineAI reads the relevant value on this Mac: the foreground or running app's bundle identifier; CPU and network counters; mounted volume names; network tunnel interface status; whether an audio device is in use; connected Bluetooth device names; the selected Wi-Fi network name; or whether a calendar event is active. Battery and thermal status are also used locally for safety rules. These values are used to evaluate your rules and are not uploaded. CaffeineAI does not read location coordinates. Calendar rules check whether an event is active; event titles and details are not saved."},{"type":"h2","text":"Permissions and controls"},{"type":"p","text":"Wi-Fi name rules require Location Services permission because macOS gates access to the network name. Calendar rules require Calendar access. Bluetooth rules read connected device names only while enabled. Turn off a rule in CaffeineAI or revoke its permission in System Settings at any time. A denied or unavailable signal does not count as a rule match."},{"type":"h2","text":"Information stored locally"},{"type":"p","text":"Your preferences and rules are stored in CaffeineAI's app container. If history is enabled, CaffeineAI stores up to 2,000 local events for no more than seven days. An event may include its timestamp, category, details, and rule or session identifiers; events about the frontmost app include its name and bundle identifier. Diagnostics show up to 100 recent events in memory and are cleared when the app quits. If you enable disk keep-alive, CaffeineAI stores the path and security-scoped bookmark for the file you select and reads one byte at your chosen interval. It never changes that file. Active sessions and power assertion identifiers are not restored after a restart."},{"type":"h2","text":"Retention and deletion"},{"type":"p","text":"Decision history expires after seven days; you can turn it off or clear it in Automation settings. Diagnostics are cleared when the app quits. Use Reset Settings in About to remove saved preferences and rules. Turn off disk keep-alive or remove its selected file to delete its bookmark. Files you export remain at the location you chose and can be deleted there."},{"type":"h2","text":"Exports"},{"type":"p","text":"Configuration exports contain settings and rules, but exclude the selected file path, its security-scoped bookmark, and active sessions. Diagnostic text is exported only after you choose Save and a destination. CaffeineAI does not transmit exported files."},{"type":"h2","text":"Sharing and contact"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI has no third-party analytics or advertising SDKs and does not share information with a developer service or other third parties. For privacy questions, contact the developer using the support contact on the CaffeineAI App Store product page."}],"zh-Hant":[{"type":"h1","text":"CaffeineAI 隱私權政策"},{"type":"p","text":"更新日期：2026 年 10 月 13 日"},{"type":"h2","text":"在此 Mac 上使用的資料"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI 不建立帳戶、不顯示廣告、不使用分析工具，也不會將資料傳送至開發者伺服器。"},{"type":"p","text":"只有在已啟用的規則需要某項訊號時，CaffeineAI 才會在這部 Mac 上讀取相關資訊：目前前景或正在執行的 App 識別碼、CPU 與網路流量計數、已掛載卷宗名稱、網路通道介面狀態、音訊裝置是否正在使用、已連線藍牙裝置名稱、所選 Wi-Fi 網路名稱，以及目前是否有日曆行程。電池與熱狀態也只會在本機用於安全規則。這些資訊僅用來判斷規則是否符合，不會上傳。CaffeineAI 不讀取位置座標。日曆規則只檢查行程是否正在進行，不會儲存標題或詳細資料。"},{"type":"h2","text":"權限與控制"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS 透過「定位服務」權限控管 Wi-Fi 網路名稱的存取，因此 Wi-Fi 名稱規則需要定位權限。日曆規則需要日曆存取權限。藍牙規則啟用時，App 只會在規則執行期間讀取已連線裝置名稱。你可以隨時在 CaffeineAI 中關閉規則，或在「系統設定」中撤銷相應權限。遭拒或無法取得的訊號不會被視為符合規則。"},{"type":"h2","text":"儲存在本機的資訊"},{"type":"p","text":"偏好設定與規則會儲存在 CaffeineAI 的 App 容器中。啟用歷史記錄後，CaffeineAI 最多會在本機保留 2,000 筆事件，最長七天。事件可能包含時間、類別、詳細資料及規則或工作階段識別碼；前景 App 變更事件會包含該 App 的名稱和 Bundle ID。診斷頁會在記憶體中顯示最近 100 筆事件，並於 App 結束時清除。啟用磁碟保活後，CaffeineAI 會儲存你所選檔案的路徑與安全書籤，並依照所選間隔讀取一個位元組；不會修改檔案。重新啟動後不會恢復進行中的工作階段或電源斷言識別碼。"},{"type":"h2","text":"保留與刪除"},{"type":"p","text":"決策歷史會在七天後過期；你可以在「自動化」設定中關閉或清除歷史。診斷記錄會在 App 結束時清除。在「關於」中使用「重置設定」可刪除已儲存的偏好與規則。關閉磁碟保活或移除所選檔案即可刪除其書籤。匯出的檔案會保留在你選擇的位置，可由你自行刪除。"},{"type":"h2","text":"匯出"},{"type":"p","text":"設定匯出包含偏好與規則，但不包含所選檔案路徑、安全書籤或進行中的工作階段。只有在你選擇「儲存」並指定位置後，診斷文字才會匯出。CaffeineAI 不會傳送匯出的檔案。"},{"type":"h2","text":"資料分享與聯絡"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI 不含第三方分析或廣告 SDK，也不會將資訊分享給開發者服務或其他第三方。如有隱私問題，請透過 CaffeineAI App Store 產品頁面上的支援聯絡方式聯絡開發者。"}],"ja":[{"type":"h1","text":"CaffeineAI プライバシーポリシー"},{"type":"p","text":"最終更新日：2026年10月13日"},{"type":"h2","text":"この Mac で使用するデータ"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI はアカウントを作成せず、広告や分析機能を使用せず、開発者のサーバーにデータを送信しません。"},{"type":"p","text":"有効なルールで信号が必要な場合に限り、この Mac 上で関連情報を読み取ります。対象は、前面または実行中のアプリのバンドル ID、CPU とネットワークのカウンター、マウント中のボリューム名、ネットワークトンネルのインターフェイス状態、オーディオデバイスの使用状態、接続中の Bluetooth デバイス名、選択した Wi-Fi ネットワーク名、カレンダーイベントが現在発生しているかどうかです。バッテリーと熱の状態もローカルの安全ルールに使用します。これらの情報はルールの判定にのみ使われ、アップロードされません。位置座標を読み取りません。カレンダールールはイベントが現在有効かどうかだけを確認し、タイトルや詳細を保存しません。"},{"type":"h2","text":"権限と設定"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS ではネットワーク名へのアクセスに位置情報サービスの許可が必要なため、Wi-Fi 名のルールには位置情報の許可が必要です。カレンダールールにはカレンダーへのアクセス許可が必要です。Bluetooth ルールは有効な間だけ接続中のデバイス名を読み取ります。CaffeineAI でルールを無効にするか、システム設定でいつでも許可を取り消せます。拒否された信号や取得できない信号は、ルール一致として扱いません。"},{"type":"h2","text":"Mac に保存される情報"},{"type":"p","text":"設定とルールは CaffeineAI のアプリコンテナに保存されます。履歴を有効にすると、CaffeineAI は最大 2,000 件のイベントを最長 7 日間ローカルに保存します。各イベントには日時、分類、詳細、ルールまたはセッション ID が含まれる場合があります。前面アプリの変更イベントにはアプリ名とバンドル ID が含まれます。診断には直近 100 件のイベントがメモリ内に表示され、アプリ終了時に消去されます。ディスクのスリープ防止を有効にすると、選択したファイルのパスとセキュリティスコープブックマークを保存し、設定した間隔で 1 バイトだけ読み取ります。ファイルは変更しません。再起動後に進行中のセッションや電源アサーション ID は復元されません。"},{"type":"h2","text":"保存期間と削除"},{"type":"p","text":"判断履歴は 7 日後に期限切れとなり、「自動化」設定から無効化または消去できます。診断情報はアプリ終了時に消去されます。「情報」画面の「設定をリセット」から保存済みの設定とルールを削除できます。ディスクのスリープ防止を無効にするか選択ファイルを解除すると、そのブックマークも削除されます。エクスポートしたファイルは選択した場所に残り、その場所で削除できます。"},{"type":"h2","text":"エクスポート"},{"type":"p","text":"設定のエクスポートには設定とルールが含まれますが、選択したファイルのパス、安全なブックマーク、進行中のセッションは含まれません。診断テキストは「保存」を選び保存先を指定した場合にのみエクスポートされます。CaffeineAI がエクスポートファイルを送信することはありません。"},{"type":"h2","text":"共有と問い合わせ"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI には第三者の分析・広告 SDK はなく、開発者のサービスやその他の第三者と情報を共有しません。プライバシーに関する質問は、CaffeineAI の App Store 製品ページに記載されたサポート窓口から開発者にお問い合わせください。"}],"ko":[{"type":"h1","text":"CaffeineAI 개인정보 처리방침"},{"type":"p","text":"최종 업데이트: 2026년 10월 13일"},{"type":"h2","text":"이 Mac에서 사용하는 데이터"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI는 계정을 만들지 않고 광고나 분석 기능을 사용하지 않으며 개발자 서버로 데이터를 보내지 않습니다."},{"type":"p","text":"활성화된 규칙에 신호가 필요한 경우에만 이 Mac에서 관련 정보를 읽습니다. 대상 정보는 전면 또는 실행 중인 앱의 번들 ID, CPU 및 네트워크 카운터, 마운트된 볼륨 이름, 네트워크 터널 인터페이스 상태, 오디오 기기 사용 여부, 연결된 Bluetooth 기기 이름, 선택한 Wi-Fi 네트워크 이름, 현재 캘린더 이벤트가 있는지 여부입니다. 배터리와 발열 상태도 로컬 안전 규칙에만 사용됩니다. 이 정보는 규칙을 평가하는 데만 사용되며 업로드되지 않습니다. 위치 좌표를 읽지 않습니다. 캘린더 규칙은 현재 이벤트가 있는지만 확인하고 제목이나 세부 정보는 저장하지 않습니다."},{"type":"h2","text":"권한과 제어"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS가 네트워크 이름 접근을 위치 서비스 권한으로 제어하므로 Wi-Fi 이름 규칙에는 위치 권한이 필요합니다. 캘린더 규칙에는 캘린더 접근 권한이 필요합니다. Bluetooth 규칙은 활성화된 동안에만 연결된 기기 이름을 읽습니다. CaffeineAI에서 규칙을 끄거나 시스템 설정에서 권한을 언제든지 철회할 수 있습니다. 거부되었거나 사용할 수 없는 신호는 규칙 일치로 처리되지 않습니다."},{"type":"h2","text":"Mac에 저장되는 정보"},{"type":"p","text":"환경설정과 규칙은 CaffeineAI 앱 컨테이너에 저장됩니다. 기록을 활성화하면 CaffeineAI는 최대 2,000개의 이벤트를 7일 동안 로컬에 보관합니다. 각 이벤트에는 시각, 범주, 세부 정보, 규칙 또는 세션 식별자가 포함될 수 있습니다. 전면 앱 변경 이벤트에는 앱 이름과 번들 ID가 포함됩니다. 진단 화면은 최근 이벤트 최대 100개를 메모리에 표시하며 앱을 종료하면 지워집니다. 디스크 유지 기능을 켜면 선택한 파일의 경로와 보안 범위 책갈피를 저장하고 설정한 간격마다 1바이트를 읽습니다. 파일을 변경하지 않습니다. 앱을 다시 시작한 뒤에는 진행 중인 세션이나 전원 어설션 식별자를 복원하지 않습니다."},{"type":"h2","text":"보관 기간과 삭제"},{"type":"p","text":"결정 기록은 7일 후 만료되며 자동화 설정에서 끄거나 지울 수 있습니다. 진단 정보는 앱 종료 시 지워집니다. 정보 화면의 설정 초기화를 사용하면 저장된 환경설정과 규칙을 삭제할 수 있습니다. 디스크 유지 기능을 끄거나 선택한 파일을 제거하면 해당 책갈피도 삭제됩니다. 내보낸 파일은 선택한 위치에 남으며 해당 위치에서 직접 삭제할 수 있습니다."},{"type":"h2","text":"내보내기"},{"type":"p","text":"구성 내보내기에는 환경설정과 규칙이 포함되지만 선택한 파일 경로, 보안 책갈피, 진행 중인 세션은 포함되지 않습니다. 진단 텍스트는 사용자가 저장을 선택하고 위치를 지정한 경우에만 내보냅니다. CaffeineAI는 내보낸 파일을 전송하지 않습니다."},{"type":"h2","text":"공유 및 문의"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI에는 타사 분석 또는 광고 SDK가 없으며 개발자 서비스나 다른 타사와 정보를 공유하지 않습니다. 개인정보 관련 문의는 CaffeineAI App Store 제품 페이지에 표시된 지원 연락처로 개발자에게 문의해 주세요."}],"fr":[{"type":"h1","text":"Politique de confidentialité de CaffeineAI"},{"type":"p","text":"Dernière mise à jour : 13 octobre 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"Données utilisées sur ce Mac"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI ne crée pas de compte, n’affiche pas de publicité, n’utilise pas d’outils d’analyse et n’envoie aucune donnée à un serveur du développeur."},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI ne lit une information sur ce Mac que lorsqu’une règle activée en a besoin : l’identifiant de bundle de l’app au premier plan ou en cours d’exécution, les compteurs du processeur et du réseau, les noms des volumes montés, l’état d’une interface de tunnel réseau, l’utilisation d’un appareil audio, le nom des appareils Bluetooth connectés, le nom du réseau Wi-Fi choisi ou la présence d’un événement de calendrier en cours. L’état de la batterie et la pression thermique servent également aux règles de sécurité locales. Ces informations servent uniquement à évaluer vos règles et ne sont pas envoyées. CaffeineAI ne lit pas les coordonnées de localisation. Les règles de calendrier vérifient uniquement si un événement est en cours ; son titre et ses détails ne sont pas enregistrés."},{"type":"h2","text":"Autorisations et contrôles"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS exige l’autorisation des services de localisation pour accéder au nom du réseau Wi-Fi. Les règles de calendrier nécessitent l’accès au calendrier. Les règles Bluetooth ne lisent le nom des appareils connectés que lorsqu’elles sont activées. Vous pouvez désactiver une règle dans CaffeineAI ou révoquer son autorisation dans Réglages Système. Un signal refusé ou indisponible ne déclenche pas une règle."},{"type":"h2","text":"Informations conservées sur le Mac"},{"type":"p","text":"Les préférences et les règles sont enregistrées dans le conteneur de l’app CaffeineAI. Si l’historique est activé, CaffeineAI conserve jusqu’à 2 000 événements locaux pendant sept jours au maximum. Chaque événement peut inclure sa date, sa catégorie, ses détails et les identifiants de règle ou de session ; les changements d’app au premier plan incluent son nom et son identifiant de bundle. Le diagnostic affiche jusqu’à 100 événements récents en mémoire et les efface lorsque l’app quitte. Si vous activez le maintien du disque, CaffeineAI conserve le chemin et le signet sécurisé du fichier choisi et en lit un octet à l’intervalle défini. Le fichier n’est jamais modifié. Les sessions actives et les identifiants d’assertion d’alimentation ne sont pas restaurés après un redémarrage."},{"type":"h2","text":"Conservation et suppression"},{"type":"p","text":"L’historique des décisions expire après sept jours ; vous pouvez le désactiver ou l’effacer dans les réglages Automatisation. Les diagnostics sont effacés à la fermeture de l’app. Utilisez Réinitialiser les réglages dans À propos pour supprimer les préférences et les règles enregistrées. Désactivez le maintien du disque ou retirez le fichier choisi pour supprimer son signet. Les fichiers exportés restent à l’emplacement choisi et vous pouvez les supprimer à cet endroit."},{"type":"h2","text":"Exports"},{"type":"p","text":"L’export de configuration contient les réglages et les règles, mais exclut le chemin du fichier choisi, son signet sécurisé et les sessions actives. Le texte de diagnostic n’est exporté qu’après votre choix d’enregistrement et de destination. CaffeineAI ne transmet pas les fichiers exportés."},{"type":"h2","text":"Partage et contact"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI n’intègre aucun SDK tiers d’analyse ou de publicité et ne partage pas d’informations avec un service du développeur ni avec d’autres tiers. Pour toute question relative à la confidentialité, contactez le développeur via les coordonnées d’assistance de la fiche CaffeineAI sur l’App Store."}],"de":[{"type":"h1","text":"Datenschutzerklärung von CaffeineAI"},{"type":"p","text":"Zuletzt aktualisiert: 13. Oktober 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"Auf diesem Mac verwendete Daten"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI erstellt keine Konten, zeigt keine Werbung an, verwendet keine Analysedienste und sendet keine Daten an einen Server des Entwicklers."},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI liest auf diesem Mac nur dann ein benötigtes Signal, wenn eine aktivierte Regel es erfordert: die Bundle-ID der aktiven oder laufenden App, CPU- und Netzwerkzähler, Namen eingebundener Volumes, den Status einer Netzwerktunnel-Schnittstelle, ob ein Audiogerät verwendet wird, Namen verbundener Bluetooth-Geräte, den Namen des ausgewählten WLANs oder ob gerade ein Kalenderereignis stattfindet. Batterie- und Wärmestatus werden außerdem lokal für Sicherheitsregeln verwendet. Diese Werte dienen ausschließlich der Auswertung deiner Regeln und werden nicht hochgeladen. CaffeineAI liest keine Standortkoordinaten. Kalenderregeln prüfen nur, ob gerade ein Ereignis stattfindet; Titel und Details werden nicht gespeichert."},{"type":"h2","text":"Berechtigungen und Kontrolle"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS verlangt die Berechtigung für Ortungsdienste, damit der WLAN-Name gelesen werden kann. Kalenderregeln benötigen Kalenderzugriff. Bluetooth-Regeln lesen Namen verbundener Geräte nur, solange sie aktiviert sind. Du kannst eine Regel jederzeit in CaffeineAI ausschalten oder die Berechtigung in den Systemeinstellungen widerrufen. Abgelehnte oder nicht verfügbare Signale gelten nicht als Treffer."},{"type":"h2","text":"Lokal gespeicherte Informationen"},{"type":"p","text":"Einstellungen und Regeln werden im App-Container von CaffeineAI gespeichert. Wenn der Verlauf aktiviert ist, speichert CaffeineAI bis zu 2.000 lokale Ereignisse für höchstens sieben Tage. Ein Ereignis kann Zeitpunkt, Kategorie, Details und Regel- oder Sitzungskennungen enthalten; Ereignisse zu Änderungen der aktiven App enthalten deren Namen und Bundle-ID. Die Diagnoseansicht hält bis zu 100 aktuelle Ereignisse nur im Arbeitsspeicher und löscht sie beim Beenden der App. Wenn du den Festplatten-Wachhalter aktivierst, speichert CaffeineAI den Pfad und das Sicherheitslesezeichen der ausgewählten Datei und liest im gewählten Intervall ein Byte. Die Datei wird nicht verändert. Aktive Sitzungen und Kennungen von Energiezusicherungen werden nach einem Neustart nicht wiederhergestellt."},{"type":"h2","text":"Aufbewahrung und Löschung"},{"type":"p","text":"Der Entscheidungsverlauf läuft nach sieben Tagen ab und kann in den Einstellungen unter Automatisierung ausgeschaltet oder gelöscht werden. Diagnosedaten werden beim Beenden der App gelöscht. Mit Einstellungen zurücksetzen unter Info entfernst du gespeicherte Einstellungen und Regeln. Schalte den Festplatten-Wachhalter aus oder entferne die ausgewählte Datei, um das Lesezeichen zu löschen. Exportierte Dateien verbleiben am gewählten Speicherort und können dort gelöscht werden."},{"type":"h2","text":"Exporte"},{"type":"p","text":"Ein Konfigurationsexport enthält Einstellungen und Regeln, aber weder den Pfad der ausgewählten Datei noch ihr Sicherheitslesezeichen oder aktive Sitzungen. Diagnosetext wird erst exportiert, wenn du Speichern auswählst und einen Speicherort angibst. CaffeineAI überträgt keine exportierten Dateien."},{"type":"h2","text":"Weitergabe und Kontakt"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI enthält keine Analyse- oder Werbe-SDKs von Drittanbietern und gibt keine Informationen an einen Entwicklerservice oder andere Dritte weiter. Bei Fragen zum Datenschutz erreichst du den Entwickler über die Support-Kontaktdaten auf der CaffeineAI-Produktseite im App Store."}],"es":[{"type":"h1","text":"Política de privacidad de CaffeineAI"},{"type":"p","text":"Última actualización: 13 de octubre de 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"Datos utilizados en este Mac"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI no crea cuentas, no muestra anuncios, no usa herramientas de análisis ni envía datos a un servidor del desarrollador."},{"type":"p","text":"Solo cuando una regla activa necesita una señal, CaffeineAI lee el dato correspondiente en este Mac: el identificador de paquete de la app en primer plano o en ejecución; los contadores de CPU y red; los nombres de los volúmenes montados; el estado de una interfaz de túnel de red; si se está usando un dispositivo de audio; los nombres de los dispositivos Bluetooth conectados; el nombre de la red Wi-Fi seleccionada; o si hay un evento de calendario activo. El estado de batería y temperatura también se usa localmente para las reglas de seguridad. Estos datos solo sirven para evaluar tus reglas y no se envían. CaffeineAI no lee coordenadas de ubicación. Las reglas de calendario solo comprueban si hay un evento activo; no guardan su título ni sus detalles."},{"type":"h2","text":"Permisos y controles"},{"type":"p","text":"macOS exige permiso de Localización para acceder al nombre de la red Wi-Fi. Las reglas de calendario requieren acceso al calendario. Las reglas de Bluetooth solo leen los nombres de dispositivos conectados mientras están activas. Puedes desactivar una regla en CaffeineAI o revocar su permiso en Ajustes del Sistema cuando quieras. Una señal denegada o no disponible no cuenta como coincidencia."},{"type":"h2","text":"Información guardada localmente"},{"type":"p","text":"Las preferencias y reglas se guardan en el contenedor de la app CaffeineAI. Si activas el historial, CaffeineAI guarda hasta 2.000 eventos locales durante un máximo de siete días. Cada evento puede incluir fecha, categoría, detalles e identificadores de regla o sesión; los eventos sobre cambios de la app en primer plano incluyen su nombre y su identificador de paquete. Diagnósticos muestra hasta 100 eventos recientes en memoria y los borra al cerrar la app. Si activas el mantenimiento del disco, CaffeineAI guarda la ruta y el marcador de seguridad del archivo que eliges y lee un byte con el intervalo seleccionado. Nunca modifica el archivo. Las sesiones activas y los identificadores de aserción de energía no se restauran tras reiniciar."},{"type":"h2","text":"Conservación y eliminación"},{"type":"p","text":"El historial de decisiones caduca a los siete días; puedes desactivarlo o borrarlo en los ajustes de Automatización. Los diagnósticos se borran al cerrar la app. Usa Restablecer ajustes en Acerca de para eliminar las preferencias y reglas guardadas. Desactiva el mantenimiento del disco o quita el archivo seleccionado para borrar su marcador. Los archivos exportados permanecen en la ubicación que elijas y puedes borrarlos allí."},{"type":"h2","text":"Exportaciones"},{"type":"p","text":"La exportación de configuración incluye ajustes y reglas, pero excluye la ruta del archivo seleccionado, su marcador de seguridad y las sesiones activas. El texto de diagnóstico solo se exporta cuando eliges Guardar y seleccionas un destino. CaffeineAI no transmite los archivos exportados."},{"type":"h2","text":"Compartición y contacto"},{"type":"p","text":"CaffeineAI no incluye SDK de análisis ni publicidad de terceros y no comparte información con un servicio del desarrollador ni con terceros. Para consultas sobre privacidad, contacta con el desarrollador mediante los datos de soporte de la ficha de CaffeineAI en el App Store."}]},"drift":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"Drift 隐私政策 (Privacy Policy)"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 10 月 1 日 | Last Updated: October 1, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"核心承诺： Drift 是一款本地优先的 macOS 实用工具。扫描在您的 Mac 本机进行，Drift 不会将文件内容或扫描数据上传给开发者或第三方。为提供授权目录记忆和扫描历史功能，应用会在本机保存安全范围书签和扫描摘要。"},{"type":"h2","text":"一、概述 (Overview)"},{"type":"p","text":"欢迎使用 Drift（以下简称“我们”或“本应用”）。我们深知您的隐私至关重要。Drift 的设计初衷是在完全不侵犯用户隐私的前提下，为 macOS 用户提供直观清晰的磁盘空间管理与清理工具。本隐私政策旨在向您说明本应用在运行期间对数据和权限的处理方式。"},{"type":"h2","text":"二、数据收集与网络传输 (Data Collection & Transmission)"},{"type":"li","text":"不建立账户或收集身份信息： Drift 不要求注册，也不向开发者收集姓名、电子邮箱、手机号或身份标识信息。"},{"type":"li","text":"扫描数据仅在本机处理： 文件内容不会上传。扫描得到的路径、名称、大小、修改时间等摘要，以及重复文件比对使用的哈希值，均在 Mac 本机处理；扫描历史摘要会按下文所述保存在本机。"},{"type":"li","text":"不含分析、广告或追踪 SDK： Drift 未集成第三方分析工具、广告 SDK 或跨应用追踪代码，不会向开发者发送使用分析或崩溃报告。"},{"type":"li","text":"外部网页： 点击隐私政策或技术支持链接时，macOS 会在默认浏览器中打开相应网页。浏览器与网站可能按其自身政策处理常规网络请求信息；这些请求不包含 Drift 扫描的文件内容或历史记录。"},{"type":"h2","text":"三、系统权限与数据存储 (Permissions & Storage)"},{"type":"li","text":"macOS 沙盒机制 (App Sandbox)： Drift 使用 App Sandbox。可扫描范围受用户选择的目录、系统授权、文件权限和 macOS 安全策略共同限制；扫描遇到无法访问的项目时会跳过或报告，不保证能够读取磁盘上的所有文件。"},{"type":"li","text":"安全范围书签 (Security-Scoped Bookmarks)： 为了记住您授权的目录，应用会将安全范围书签保存在本机应用偏好设置中。书签用于后续访问相应目录，不会上传或与外界共享。"},{"type":"li","text":"历史快照记录 (Local Snapshots)： Drift 会在应用沙盒的 Application Support 目录保存扫描历史摘要，其中可能包含目录和文件路径、名称、大小、修改时间及计数信息。默认保留最多 20 条未固定快照；固定的快照会保留至您手动删除。您可在应用的历史记录中删除单条快照。"},{"type":"li","text":"移入废纸篓操作 (Trash Operation)： 清理操作使用 macOS 原生 FileManager.trashItem 将目标移入系统废纸篓，不会主动执行不可逆的永久删除。文件通常可在用户清空废纸篓前恢复。"},{"type":"h2","text":"四、完全磁盘访问权限说明 (Full Disk Access)"},{"type":"p","text":"您可以在 macOS“隐私与安全性”设置中自行决定是否向 Drift 授予完全磁盘访问权限。该权限可能扩大可扫描范围，但不保证所有位置都可读取；App Sandbox、POSIX 权限、访问控制列表、系统完整性保护及其他 macOS 安全策略仍可能阻止访问。Drift 会按实际可访问内容生成结果，并在遇到权限限制时跳过或报告相关项目。无论授权状态如何，文件内容和扫描历史都不会上传给开发者或第三方。"},{"type":"h2","text":"五、隐私政策的更新 (Policy Changes)"},{"type":"p","text":"若我们对 Drift 的功能进行了更新升级，可能会对本隐私政策进行微调。任何变更均会在本页面及时公示，并在版本更新日志中提示。"},{"type":"h2","text":"六、联系我们 (Contact Information)"},{"type":"p","text":"如果您对 Drift 的隐私政策有任何疑问、建议或顾虑，可以访问技术支持网站或通过电子邮件联系开发者："},{"type":"li","text":"技术支持页面： 查看 Drift 技术支持"},{"type":"li","text":"电子邮件： zipmaster_support@126.com"},{"type":"h2","text":"English Summary"},{"type":"p","text":"Drift processes scans locally and does not upload file contents or scan history to the developer or third parties. The app stores authorized-folder bookmarks and scan summaries on your Mac. Access can still be limited by App Sandbox, file permissions, and macOS security protections, including when Full Disk Access is enabled. Drift includes no analytics, advertising, or cross-app tracking SDKs. For support, visit the Drift support page or email zipmaster_support@126.com ."},{"type":"p","text":"© 2026 Drift App. All rights reserved. 返回首页"}]},"folderify":{"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"Folderify Privacy Policy & Disclaimer"},{"type":"p","text":"Thank you for using Folderify (hereinafter referred to as \"the App\"). Folderify is a local macOS utility for designing and applying custom Finder folder icons. This page explains what the App processes, where that processing takes place, and what happens when you choose to contact support or request a review."},{"type":"h2","text":"I. Privacy Policy"},{"type":"h3","text":"1. Information Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"The App does not collect or transmit personal information to the developer . It does not require an account, registration, or login, and it has no developer-operated server. Folderify processes the folder URLs you select or drag into the App only to validate the folders, preview a design, and apply or restore Finder folder icons. These operations are performed locally on your Mac and are not uploaded, synchronized, or shared by the App."},{"type":"h3","text":"2. File and Data Processing"},{"type":"li","text":"All rendering, including colors, gradients, materials, SF Symbols, emoji, monograms, badges, presets, and previews, takes place locally on your Mac;"},{"type":"li","text":"The App checks whether selected items are directories and, when you enable the subfolder option, enumerates eligible nested directories. It does not read, copy, modify, delete, or transmit the contents of files inside those folders;"},{"type":"li","text":"To provide its core function, the App writes or removes Finder custom-icon metadata for the folders you select. Restoring an icon removes that custom-icon metadata; it does not delete the folder or its contents;"},{"type":"li","text":"Folderify does not persist the folder URLs you select. A temporary folder may be created in macOS temporary storage when you drag a rendered icon folder out of the App; the App schedules that temporary source for removal after the drag operation."},{"type":"h3","text":"3. Local Design Data"},{"type":"p","text":"If you use History or Favorites, the App stores design snapshots locally through macOS preferences. A snapshot can include colors, material choices, symbol names, monogram or badge text, emoji, layout values, and a timestamp; it does not include the contents of your folders or the folder URLs. You can clear History and Favorites in the App. This local data is not sent to the developer."},{"type":"h3","text":"4. Logs, Support, and Reviews"},{"type":"p","text":"Folderify does not send analytics or diagnostic reports. macOS may record local diagnostic messages generated by the App; some messages can contain the path of a folder involved in an operation. Folderify does not upload those messages. If you choose Contact Us, the App opens your mail client with a support address; any message, attachments, and technical details you decide to send are handled by your email provider and the recipient. If you request an App Store rating, Apple’s StoreKit and App Store services handle that interaction under Apple’s terms and privacy policy."},{"type":"h3","text":"5. Network and Third-Party Services"},{"type":"p","text":"The App does not require an internet connection for its folder-icon features and does not include advertising, third-party analytics, tracking, cloud storage, or other data-collection SDKs. The App uses Apple system frameworks such as Finder services, App Sandbox, and StoreKit to provide the features described above; those Apple services are governed by Apple’s own terms and privacy practices."},{"type":"h3","text":"6. Data Security and Permissions"},{"type":"p","text":"Folderify uses the macOS App Sandbox and requests read/write access only for folders that you explicitly choose in the system file picker or drag into the App. The App uses security-scoped access for the duration of the relevant operation and does not create persistent folder bookmarks. macOS permissions, file ownership, and other system controls may still limit what the App can change."},{"type":"h3","text":"7. Children's Privacy"},{"type":"p","text":"The App is not directed to children under 13 years of age and does not collect any information from children."},{"type":"h3","text":"8. Policy Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will supersede earlier versions and be published within the App and on this webpage."},{"type":"h3","text":"9. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have any questions or suggestions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via:"},{"type":"p","text":"Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"},{"type":"h2","text":"II. Disclaimer"},{"type":"h3","text":"1. Scope of Use"},{"type":"p","text":"The App is intended solely for lawful folder icon styling, customization, and desktop organization in personal or commercial environments. Users must not use the App for any unlawful activities."},{"type":"h3","text":"2. Data Risks & Folder Integrity"},{"type":"p","text":"Folderify writes or removes Finder custom-icon metadata and may update folder metadata to help Finder refresh its display. If you enable the subfolder option, the same operation may be applied to eligible nested folders. Folderify does not intentionally modify, delete, or re-encode the contents of files inside those folders. Please maintain backups of important data and verify the selected folders before applying changes. The developer is not responsible for data loss, unavailable files, or unexpected Finder behavior caused by hardware, operating-system, permission, storage, or user errors."},{"type":"h3","text":"3. Compatibility and Performance"},{"type":"p","text":"The App has been tested on officially supported macOS versions. However, due to macOS Finder icon caching mechanisms or third-party Finder extension behaviors, icon updates may occasionally require a Finder reload or cache refresh. We assume no liability for system-level Finder rendering delays or minor visual discrepancies across different macOS releases."},{"type":"h3","text":"4. Third-Party Resources & Symbols"},{"type":"p","text":"The App uses Apple system symbols (SF Symbols), system emoji, and other macOS-provided resources for folder customization. SF Symbols and Apple trademarks are governed by Apple’s applicable license terms. You are responsible for ensuring that any text, emoji, or other material you choose to place in a design is lawful and does not infringe third-party rights."},{"type":"h3","text":"5. Icon Reset Functionality"},{"type":"p","text":"The App provides options to restore default system folder icons. In rare circumstances where macOS Finder cache delays icon restoration, users can also reset folder icons via the native macOS \"Get Info\" inspector."},{"type":"h3","text":"6. Software Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"We may release updates periodically to enhance rendering quality, introduce new customization features, or resolve compatibility issues. Users are responsible for keeping the App updated to ensure an optimal experience."},{"type":"h2","text":"III. Additional Notice"},{"type":"p","text":"Folderify is an independently developed utility software with no affiliation, partnership, or endorsement by Apple Inc. macOS, Finder, SF Symbols, and Apple are registered trademarks of Apple Inc. in the United States and other countries."}]},"localdrop":{"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"LocalDrop Server Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective date: October 1, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"This policy applies to LocalDrop Server for macOS. The app runs HTTP and traditional FTP file services on your Mac and describes information it stores and processes locally. The marketing and support pages on GitHub Pages are hosted by GitHub; GitHub's policies apply to requests made to those webpages."},{"type":"p","text":"This policy is published by LocalDrop Team, the maintainer of LocalDrop Server."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Information handled on your Mac"},{"type":"li","text":"Settings and account details: The app stores server ports, Bonjour name, transfer limits, account names and permissions, shared-folder names and paths, and macOS security-scoped bookmarks on your Mac. Passwords are stored in macOS Keychain. The app has no cloud backend for collecting this information and does not send it to a LocalDrop server."},{"type":"li","text":"Files and folders: The app accesses folders you explicitly select using the macOS file picker. When you start the server, LAN clients can browse, download, or upload files according to the account permissions you configure. Your Mac serves the files directly; LocalDrop does not relay them through a cloud service."},{"type":"li","text":"Activity and transfer history: While the app is running, its interface keeps recent activity and transfer status in memory. Entries may include file names or operation error details. The app does not upload these lists, and they are not retained after the app exits."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. LAN transfers and the clipboard"},{"type":"p","text":"HTTP and traditional FTP do not encrypt file contents or login credentials. Others able to observe the same network traffic may see them. Use these protocols only on a trusted network and do not forward the server ports to the public internet. If you choose “Copy Credentials,” usernames, passwords, and connection addresses are placed on the macOS clipboard, which is then managed by macOS and other apps with clipboard access."},{"type":"p","text":"The app uses Bonjour to announce its services on the local network. This does not send shared-folder details or passwords to the cloud."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Local diagnostics, exports, and backups"},{"type":"li","text":"Diagnostic events: Local event recording is on by default. You can turn it off or clear events in Settings. Events stay in the running process's memory, are limited to 100 entries, and disappear when the app exits. They may include action categories and times, transfer protocol and direction, file-size ranges, and the macOS version detected after an unexpected exit. A local preference flag records that the server was running so the app can detect an unexpected exit the next time it launches. The app does not send these events to the developer or an analytics service."},{"type":"li","text":"Diagnostic report: If you choose to copy a report, it may include your macOS version, network interface and status, a masked local IPv4 address, Bonjour name, shared-folder names and full paths, account names and permissions, and diagnostic results. Review it and remove anything you do not want to share before sending it."},{"type":"li","text":"Event export: A diagnostic events JSON file you choose to export may contain event names, categories, timestamps, protocol, transfer direction, file-size ranges, and the system version after an unexpected exit. You control where the exported file is saved, shared, and deleted."},{"type":"li","text":"Configuration backup: A backup you choose to create contains server settings, shared-folder names and paths, account names, permissions, and the diagnostics setting. It does not contain account passwords or security-scoped bookmarks. Because it may reveal your local folder structure, store it carefully."},{"type":"p","text":"The diagnostics preference is stored in local settings. Turning diagnostics off clears the current in-memory events; you can also use the Clear control. Copies and exports you have already made are not affected by the app's later cleanup."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Purchases and third-party processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Pro purchases and restoration use Apple StoreKit. Apple processes purchase and transaction information under its privacy policy; LocalDrop does not receive payment-card numbers. Apart from Apple's purchase services, macOS Keychain, and LAN devices you choose to connect, the app does not send the app information described above to developer-operated servers or third-party analytics services."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Retention and deletion"},{"type":"p","text":"Local settings, account details, and shared-folder information remain on your Mac until you change or remove them in the app or delete the app's local data. Passwords are updated or removed from Keychain when you change or delete an account. macOS Keychain items may remain after you uninstall the app; to remove them, use Keychain Access to find and delete the relevant com.muzi.localdrop items."},{"type":"p","text":"Diagnostic events and activity/transfer lists exist only in memory while the app runs. You manage backups, copied reports, and clipboard contents that you create. LocalDrop has no cloud user records for the developer to retrieve or delete."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Children and policy changes"},{"type":"p","text":"LocalDrop Server does not provide online user registration or a service directed to children. If the app's data practices change, we will update the public policy and the effective date on this page."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Contact"},{"type":"p","text":"For privacy questions or requests, contact zipmaster_support@126.com ."}],"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"LocalDrop Server 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 10 月 1 日"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策适用于 macOS 版 LocalDrop Server。应用在 Mac 上运行 HTTP 与传统 FTP 文件服务，以下说明应用在本机保存和处理的信息。GitHub Pages 上的宣传或支持网页由 GitHub 托管，其网页请求处理适用 GitHub 的相关政策。"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策由 LocalDrop Team（LocalDrop Server 的维护者）发布。"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 应用在本机处理的信息"},{"type":"li","text":"设置和账户资料： 应用在 Mac 本机保存服务端口、Bonjour 广播名称、传输限制、账户名、权限设置、共享文件夹名称和路径，以及 macOS 安全书签。密码保存在 macOS 钥匙串中。应用没有用于收集这些资料的云端后端，不会将其发送到 LocalDrop 服务器。"},{"type":"li","text":"文件和目录： 应用只访问用户通过 macOS 文件选择器明确选取的共享目录。用户启动服务后，局域网客户端可以根据账户权限浏览、下载或上传文件；文件由 Mac 直接提供，不经过 LocalDrop 云端中转。"},{"type":"li","text":"活动和传输记录： 应用运行期间会在内存中显示近期活动和传输状态，其中可能出现文件名或操作错误信息。应用不会上传这些列表，退出应用后不保留。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 局域网传输和剪贴板"},{"type":"p","text":"HTTP 和传统 FTP 不加密传输内容或登录凭据。能够观察同一网络流量的人可能看到这些信息。请只在可信网络使用，不要把服务端口映射到公网。用户主动选择“复制登录信息”时，用户名、密码和连接地址会写入 macOS 剪贴板，之后由 macOS 和其他有权访问剪贴板的应用管理。"},{"type":"p","text":"应用使用 Bonjour 在本地网络公布服务，以便设备发现；这不会把共享目录或密码发送到云端。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 本地诊断、导出和备份"},{"type":"li","text":"诊断事件： 本地事件记录默认开启，可在“设置”中关闭或清空。记录只保存在当前运行进程的内存中，最多 100 条；退出应用后会消失。事件可能包括操作类别和时间、传输协议、方向、文件大小区间，以及意外退出后检测到的 macOS 版本。应用会在本机偏好设置中保存一个服务运行标记，以便下次启动判断是否异常退出。应用不会把这些事件发送给开发者或分析服务。"},{"type":"li","text":"诊断报告： 用户主动复制报告时，报告可能包含 macOS 版本、网络接口和状态、掩码后的本地 IPv4 地址、Bonjour 名称、共享文件夹名称及完整路径、账户名和权限、诊断结果。发送前请检查并删除不希望分享的内容。"},{"type":"li","text":"事件导出： 用户主动导出的诊断事件 JSON 可能包含事件名称、类别、时间、协议、传输方向、文件大小区间和意外退出时的系统版本。导出文件由用户自行保存、分享和删除。"},{"type":"li","text":"配置备份： 用户主动创建的备份包含服务器设置、共享文件夹名称和路径、账户名、权限和诊断开关状态；不包含账户密码或安全书签。备份可能透露本机目录结构，请妥善保管。"},{"type":"p","text":"诊断开关的选择保存在本机设置中。关闭诊断记录会清除当前内存事件；用户也可使用“清空”。用户已复制或导出的资料不受应用后续清理操作影响。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 购买和第三方处理"},{"type":"p","text":"Pro 购买和恢复通过 Apple StoreKit 处理。Apple 会按其隐私政策处理购买和交易信息；LocalDrop 不接收支付卡号。除 Apple 提供的购买服务、macOS 钥匙串以及用户主动连接的局域网设备外，应用不会向开发者服务器或第三方分析服务发送上述应用数据。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 保存期限和删除"},{"type":"p","text":"本地设置、账户资料和共享目录信息会保留在 Mac 上，直到用户在应用中更改或移除它们，或删除应用相关的本机数据。密码会在用户更改或删除账户时从钥匙串中更新或移除。钥匙串项目可能在卸载应用后仍然存在；如需清除，可在“钥匙串访问”中查找服务 com.muzi.localdrop 并删除相应项目。"},{"type":"p","text":"诊断事件和活动/传输列表只在应用运行期间保存在内存中。用户创建的备份、手动复制的报告和剪贴板内容由用户自行管理。LocalDrop 没有可供开发者检索或删除的云端用户资料。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 儿童和政策变更"},{"type":"p","text":"LocalDrop Server 不提供在线用户注册或面向儿童的服务。如果应用的数据处理方式发生变化，我们会更新公开政策并修改本页的生效日期。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 联系方式"},{"type":"p","text":"隐私问题或请求请联系 zipmaster_support@126.com 。"},{"type":"p","text":"© 2026 LocalDrop Team. 产品首页 · 隐私政策 · 技术支持与反馈"}]},"medialens":{"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"MediaLens Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens is a macOS app for inspecting local media files and checking them against media delivery quality rules. This Privacy Policy explains what information the App processes, what it keeps on your Mac, and what happens when you export or share a report."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Information MediaLens Processes"},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens processes files and folders that you choose in the macOS file picker or drag into the App. For folder scans, it looks for supported media and manifest files within the selected folder. Analysis is performed locally on your Mac. Depending on the file and report, the App may read or derive:"},{"type":"li","text":"File names, local paths, file sizes, and modification dates;"},{"type":"li","text":"Container, duration, video, audio, subtitle, language, color, and other technical metadata, including metadata embedded in media files;"},{"type":"li","text":"Quality assurance results, rule evidence, parser information, and error details;"},{"type":"li","text":"A SHA-256 hash of a media file when available; and"},{"type":"li","text":"Text and stream references in a local HLS or DASH manifest that you select."},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens does not modify your original media files. It does not upload media files, manifests, or analysis results to the developer or a developer-operated server. Manifest URLs are treated as text for local analysis; MediaLens does not fetch the referenced streams."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Local History, Cache, and Preferences"},{"type":"p","text":"To make recent work easier to reopen, MediaLens keeps up to 20 recent file records and 20 recent folder records on your Mac. A record can contain a file or folder name and path, the time it was opened or scanned, selected summary fields, and a macOS security-scoped bookmark that lets the App request access again. macOS may also show opened files in its own recent-items interface."},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens saves local scan-cache entries in its Application Support data. A cache entry contains a file fingerprint (path, size, and modification time) and the corresponding analysis report so the App can reuse a prior result. The cache does not contain a copy of the original media file. The App also stores preferences, the selected QA preset, and any custom QA presets you import."},{"type":"p","text":"You can clear recent file and folder records using the App's recent-history controls. The current version does not provide a separate control to clear the scan cache or imported custom presets. Those items remain in MediaLens' local app data until you remove that data from your Mac. Because MediaLens does not send these records to the developer, there is no server copy to request deletion of."},{"type":"p","text":"To remove all MediaLens local data in a sandboxed installation, quit the App and delete its container folder at ~/Library/Containers/com.muzi.medialens . This also removes saved history, bookmarks, preferences, and custom presets. For an installation that is not sandboxed, the scan cache is in ~/Library/Application Support/MediaLens/ScanCache ."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Reports and Sharing"},{"type":"p","text":"When you choose to export a report, MediaLens writes it to the location you select. Reports can include file names and paths, technical metadata, hashes, scan status, QA findings, timestamps, and preset or parser details. Batch report export offers path redaction; without redaction, a report may reveal local folder names or your macOS account name through its file paths. Review a report before sharing it."},{"type":"p","text":"If you choose a copy command, MediaLens places the selected summary or SHA-256 value on the macOS clipboard. Other apps may be able to access clipboard contents under macOS behavior. When you drag an HTML report from the App, MediaLens creates a temporary HTML file in macOS temporary storage; it may remain there until you or macOS removes it."},{"type":"p","text":"If you send, upload, or otherwise share an exported or dragged report, the recipient and any service you use to share it will receive the information contained in that report. That sharing is under your control."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Network, Analytics, and Diagnostics"},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens has no account, advertising, tracking, analytics, or cloud-sync feature. The App does not send usage data or diagnostic reports to the developer. macOS and Apple services may process information under Apple's own terms and privacy practices when you use system features, download the App, or use the App Store. See Apple's Privacy Policy for details."},{"type":"p","text":"If you contact support, any information or attachments you choose to include will be sent through your email provider and received by the support address below. MediaLens does not send an email on your behalf without your action."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. File Access and Security"},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens uses the macOS file picker and user-selected file access to read the media or folders you choose. The App's sandbox permissions allow it to save reports to a destination you select and to keep its own local history, preferences, and scan cache. Access to selected files remains subject to macOS permissions and your choices."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Children's Privacy"},{"type":"p","text":"MediaLens is a desktop utility and does not knowingly collect personal information from children. The App has no account or online profile feature."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Changes to This Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"We may update this Privacy Policy when the App or its data practices change. The updated version and effective date will be published on this page."},{"type":"h2","text":"8. Contact"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact:"},{"type":"p","text":"Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"}]},"zipmaster":{"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"ZipMaster Privacy Policy & Disclaimer"},{"type":"p","text":"Thank you for using ZipMaster (hereinafter referred to as \"the App\"). We attach great importance to your privacy and data security. This page explains how the App collects, uses, and protects your information."},{"type":"h2","text":"I. Privacy Policy"},{"type":"h3","text":"1. Information Collection"},{"type":"p","text":"The App does not actively collect any personal identifiable information . During use, the App will never require you to register, log in, upload, or synchronize any personal data. The App may access your local file system solely to perform file compression, extraction, or browsing. These operations are executed exclusively on your local device and will never be uploaded to any remote servers."},{"type":"h3","text":"2. File and Data Processing"},{"type":"li","text":"All compression and extraction operations are executed locally on your device;"},{"type":"li","text":"The App does not access, transmit, or store your file contents;"},{"type":"li","text":"Temporary files required for tasks are used strictly during processing and are automatically purged upon completion."},{"type":"h3","text":"3. Logs and Diagnostic Information"},{"type":"p","text":"Unless you proactively choose to \"Send Feedback\" or \"Report an Issue\", the App does not collect any diagnostic logs or error reports. If you reach out to us, we may collect minimal necessary information (such as macOS version, App build number) to assist in resolving the issue."},{"type":"h3","text":"4. Third-Party Services"},{"type":"p","text":"The App does not embed any third-party analytics, advertising, tracking, or cloud storage SDKs. All functionalities are implemented locally on your device."},{"type":"h3","text":"5. Data Security"},{"type":"p","text":"The App strictly complies with the macOS App Sandbox security model, accessing files only within the scope authorized by the user. For encrypted archives, password information is used only for the current task and is never uploaded or shared."},{"type":"h3","text":"6. Children's Privacy"},{"type":"p","text":"The App is not directed to children under 13 years of age and does not collect any information from children."},{"type":"h3","text":"7. Policy Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated version will supersede earlier versions and be published within the App."},{"type":"h3","text":"8. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have any questions or suggestions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via:"},{"type":"p","text":"Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"},{"type":"h2","text":"II. Disclaimer"},{"type":"h3","text":"1. Scope of Use"},{"type":"p","text":"The App is intended solely for lawful file compression and extraction in personal or commercial environments. Users must not use the App for any unlawful activities."},{"type":"h3","text":"2. Data Risks"},{"type":"p","text":"Please ensure you have backed up important data before processing files. The developer assumes no responsibility for file damage or loss caused by hardware malfunction, operating system errors, or user mistakes."},{"type":"h3","text":"3. Compatibility and Performance"},{"type":"p","text":"The App has been tested on officially supported macOS versions. However, compatibility issues may still arise on specific configurations or rare file formats. We assume no liability for performance fluctuations or third-party format parsing errors."},{"type":"h3","text":"4. Third-Party Format Support"},{"type":"p","text":"The App supports various common compression and archive formats and may utilize open-source components. These components are governed by their respective licenses, and the developer assumes no legal liability for their internal implementations."},{"type":"h3","text":"5. Password Protection Feature"},{"type":"p","text":"When encrypting archives with a password, please keep your password safe. If lost, the App cannot recover encrypted files and is not responsible for any resulting data loss."},{"type":"h3","text":"6. Software Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"We may release updates periodically to enhance performance or resolve issues. Users are responsible for keeping the App updated to ensure optimal experience and security."},{"type":"h2","text":"III. Additional Notice"},{"type":"p","text":"ZipMaster is an independently developed file utility with no affiliation or partnership with Apple Inc. or other third-party software vendors. All trademarks and format names (ZIP, 7z, RAR, etc.) are the property of their respective owners and are used strictly for descriptive compatibility purposes."}]},"couple":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026-10-23"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 适用范围与联系方式"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策适用于 iPhone 版 Couple（小家）及其小组件，由 Couple 维护者发布。我们不提供独立于 Apple 账户的注册系统，不运营用于收集应用资料的自建服务器，也未接入广告、跨应用追踪或第三方统计 SDK。隐私与支持问题请联系 zipmaster_support@126.com。"},{"type":"p","text":"应用数据会按你使用的功能保存在本机、Apple CloudKit 与 iCloud 云盘。公开政策和支持网页由 GitHub Pages 托管；访问网页时，GitHub 会按其自身政策处理网页请求。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 处理的数据与用途"},{"type":"p","text":"你主动填写的资产余额、账本收支、预算、结算、目标、愿望、纪念日、待办、心情与留言、互动记录，用于展示、统计、提醒、共同管理和导出。头像与称呼用于识别小家成员。"},{"type":"p","text":"证件资料可能包含姓名、号码后四位、有效期、存放位置、备注、扫描件、PDF 和 OCR 文本。家庭资料可能包含保险、医疗信息、血型、过敏、用药、紧急联系人姓名、关系和电话。请只添加你有权保存和分享的信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"开启位置共享后，应用处理坐标、定位精度和更新时间，让共享小家成员查看你的最近位置。位置共享默认关闭，可随时关闭；关闭时会尝试删除该成员云端的最近位置，网络失败时应重试。"},{"type":"p","text":"个人 iCloud 自动备份默认开启，可在“我们 → iCloud 数据持久化”关闭。备份包含上述业务资料、备份时间、摘要和设备名称，不包含位置共享记录和个人头像。恢复当前共享会话所需的信息保存在本机，并尝试保存到该 Apple 账户的私有 CloudKit 和 iCloud 云盘。小组件仅使用本机 App Group 快照，不直接连接 CloudKit。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. iCloud 与共同小家"},{"type":"p","text":"个人备份保存在当前 Apple 账户的 CloudKit 私有空间和 iCloud 云盘。创建的小家通过 CloudKit 共享空间同步业务资料、附件、头像和可选位置；共享成员可以读取和修改这些共同内容。"},{"type":"p","text":"创建者在绑定页分享小家二维码图片，对方扫描后通过 Apple 的 CloudKit 共享完成绑定。二维码内包含一次性共享授权信息，绑定后会关联领取者的 Apple 账户；请只把二维码图片交给预期成员。新版本不会将该授权信息写入 CloudKit 公共数据库；恢复当前共享会话所需的信息保存在本机，并尝试保存到该 Apple 账户的私有 CloudKit 和 iCloud 云盘。"},{"type":"p","text":"历史版本的小家可能保留 CloudKit 公共数据库中的共享快照、成员记录和绑定映射。创建者升级后会尝试迁移到新的共享方式并清理旧映射；数据删除也会尝试清理遗留记录，遇到权限不足会提示未完成。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 系统权限"},{"type":"p","text":"相机用于扫描证件和小家二维码；OCR 与二维码识别均在设备上完成。系统照片选择器只向应用提供你选定的图片；识别二维码时，应用不会访问相册中的其他图片，也不会保存所选二维码图片。头像图片会按资料功能保存在本机，并可能同步至小家或个人备份。"},{"type":"p","text":"Face ID 或设备密码由系统验证，应用不会取得面容模板或设备密码。通知用于纪念日、证件、待办、预算和对方动态提醒。定位权限仅在主动开启位置共享后请求；后台定位用于 App 不在前台时更新最近位置，实际更新受 iOS、电量与网络限制，不能保证实时或用作紧急救援。"},{"type":"p","text":"可以在 App 和 iOS 设置中管理这些权限。拒绝可选权限不会阻止使用无关的本地记录功能。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 数据保护与分享边界"},{"type":"p","text":"Apple 根据其服务与安全机制保护 CloudKit 和 iCloud 中的数据。应用不对所有资料作“端到端加密”或“任何第三方绝不可能访问”的承诺。共享资料会向有权限的小家成员开放。"},{"type":"p","text":"单独填写的完整证件号码在本机使用 AES-GCM 加密，密钥存放于当前设备钥匙串且不随应用备份同步；加密后的字段可能随资料同步或备份。扫描件、PDF、OCR 文本或备注仍可能包含完整号码及其他敏感内容，并可被共享成员读取。请在上传或分享前检查。"},{"type":"p","text":"你主动导出的 PDF、CSV、截图、系统剪贴板内容和分享给其他 App 的文件，由你和接收方另行管理。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 保存、删除与退出"},{"type":"p","text":"入口为“我们 → 隐私与安全 → 删除数据”。确认前会说明当前操作影响的成员和数据范围。普通“解除本机绑定”只停止本机连接，不删除共享小家。"},{"type":"p","text":"创建者：删除当前连接的小家及其 CloudKit 共享内容、附件、头像、历史绑定映射和可访问的旧版记录。对方将失去该小家的共享访问；删除不会替你清理对方另行保存的本地副本或个人备份。"},{"type":"p","text":"加入者：删除共享空间中的本人称呼与头像、最近位置、心情、心跳、归属本人的证件及附件、相关证件任务与编辑记录、归属本人的待办和宠物互动时间，然后退出共享。共同资产、账本、愿望、纪念日、旅行说明及无法按成员区分的家庭/健康资料仍归创建者保留；其中如有你的个人信息，请在退出前逐项删除。"},{"type":"p","text":"上述操作还删除当前 Apple 账户的 Couple 个人 CloudKit 备份、iCloud 云盘备份与绑定恢复文件，以及当前设备上的业务资料、头像缓存、文档加密密钥、小组件快照、提醒和应用临时导出文件。未绑定时只处理本机和个人备份；以前已解绑的小家需重新连接后单独处理。"},{"type":"p","text":"删除需要当前 Apple 账户、网络及 iCloud 云盘可用。云端步骤失败时不显示全部完成；应用保留删除进度并暂停同步、备份与自动恢复，直到你重试完成。完成后自动备份保持关闭，需要主动重新开启。删除不注销 Apple 账户。"},{"type":"p","text":"未连接小家时，也可明确选择“仅清除本机（保留云端）”，无需登录 iCloud。此选择不删除个人云端备份或以前的小家；会暂停自动恢复与备份，直到你主动重新启用相关功能。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 保留的副本、权利与政策更新"},{"type":"p","text":"记录通常保留到你在 App 中删除相应项目或执行上述数据删除。单项删除共享项目不会自动清除已有的个人历史备份。对方设备、本账户其他设备、已导出文件、系统设备备份和 Apple 依法保留的服务记录不一定会随当前设备操作一并消失；请分别管理这些副本，避免从旧备份重新导入已删除资料。"},{"type":"p","text":"我们不出售你的数据，也不用于广告画像。可通过 App 管理权限、导出支持的资料、修改与删除记录。应用不面向儿童提供独立在线注册服务。政策发生变化时会更新页面和生效日期；如需帮助，请发送邮件，避免附上完整证件、医疗或财务资料。"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective date：2026-10-23"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Scope and contact"},{"type":"p","text":"This policy covers Couple for iPhone and its widgets, maintained by the Couple maintainer. The app has no separate registration system, developer-operated data backend, advertising, cross-app tracking, or third-party analytics SDK. Contact zipmaster_support@126.com for privacy and support questions."},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the features you use, app data is stored on your device, in Apple CloudKit, and in iCloud Drive. The public policy and support pages are hosted by GitHub Pages, which processes webpage requests under its own policies."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Data and purposes"},{"type":"p","text":"Asset balances, ledger entries, budgets, settlements, goals, wishes, anniversaries, tasks, moods, notes, and interaction records you enter support display, summaries, reminders, shared management, and exports. Names and avatars identify household members."},{"type":"p","text":"Document data may include names, the last four digits of numbers, expiry dates, storage locations, notes, scans, PDFs, and OCR text. Family records may include insurance and medical information, blood type, allergies, medication, and emergency contacts’ names, relationships, and phone numbers. Only add information you are entitled to store and share."},{"type":"p","text":"Optional location sharing processes coordinates, accuracy, and timestamps to show your recent location to household members. It is off by default and can be disabled at any time. Disabling it attempts to remove your last shared location; retry if the network request fails."},{"type":"p","text":"Automatic personal iCloud backup is on by default and can be disabled in We → iCloud Data Persistence. Backups include business records, backup time, summaries, and device name, but not shared location records or profile avatars. Information needed to restore the current sharing session is stored on the device and is also saved to the Apple Account’s private CloudKit and iCloud Drive when available. Widgets use a local App Group snapshot and do not connect directly to CloudKit."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. iCloud and household sharing"},{"type":"p","text":"Personal backups are stored in the current Apple Account’s private CloudKit space and iCloud Drive. A household synchronizes business records, attachments, avatars, and optional location through CloudKit sharing. Shared members can read and edit these records."},{"type":"p","text":"The owner shares a household QR image, which the other person scans to join through Apple CloudKit sharing. The QR contains one-time sharing authorization associated with the recipient’s Apple Account after binding. Share the image only with the intended member. New app versions do not write this authorization to the public CloudKit database. Information needed to restore the current sharing session is stored on the device and is also saved to the Apple Account’s private CloudKit and iCloud Drive when available."},{"type":"p","text":"Households created by earlier app versions may retain snapshots, member records, and binding mappings in the public CloudKit database. The owner’s updated app attempts to migrate to the current sharing model and remove old mappings. Deletion also attempts to remove legacy records and reports incomplete deletion if permissions prevent it."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. System permissions"},{"type":"p","text":"The camera is used for document and household QR scanning; OCR and QR recognition run on the device. The system photo picker provides only the images you select. For QR recognition, the app does not access other photos or save the selected QR image. Avatar images are stored for the profile feature and may be synchronized or backed up as described above."},{"type":"p","text":"Face ID and device-passcode authentication are performed by iOS; the app does not receive biometric templates or the passcode. Notifications support anniversaries, documents, tasks, budgets, and partner updates. Location permission is requested after you enable sharing. Background location updates your recent location while the app is not foregrounded, subject to iOS, power, and network limits. It is not guaranteed to be real time or suitable for emergency rescue."},{"type":"p","text":"Manage permissions in the app and iOS Settings. Declining optional permissions does not prevent unrelated local record features."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Protection and sharing boundaries"},{"type":"p","text":"Apple protects CloudKit and iCloud data under its service and security mechanisms. The app does not claim end-to-end encryption for all records or that no third party could ever access any data. Authorized household members can access shared records."},{"type":"p","text":"A full document number entered in its dedicated field is encrypted on-device using AES-GCM with a key in this device’s Keychain; the key is not synchronized with app backups. The encrypted field may accompany synchronized records or backups. Scans, PDFs, OCR text, and notes can still contain full numbers or other sensitive information readable by shared members. Review them before uploading or sharing."},{"type":"p","text":"PDFs, CSVs, screenshots, clipboard contents, and files you explicitly share with another app are managed separately by you and their recipients."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Retention, deletion, and leaving"},{"type":"p","text":"Go to We → Privacy & Security → Delete Data. The confirmation explains which members and records are affected. Disconnect on This Device only disconnects the device and does not delete the household."},{"type":"p","text":"Owner: delete the currently connected household, CloudKit shared records, attachments, avatars, legacy binding mappings, and accessible legacy records. The other member loses shared access. This does not erase local copies or personal backups separately retained by that member."},{"type":"p","text":"Participant: remove your shared name/avatar, recent location, moods, heartbeats, documents and attachments assigned to you, related document tasks/history, tasks assigned to you, and your pet interaction timestamps, then leave the share. Shared assets, ledger, wishes, anniversaries, trip notes, and family/health records without member ownership remain with the owner. Delete any personal information in those common records individually before leaving."},{"type":"p","text":"The operation also removes this Apple Account’s personal Couple CloudKit backup, iCloud Drive backup/recovery files, and this device’s business records, avatar cache, document encryption key, widget snapshot, reminders, and app temporary exports. When unbound, only local data and personal backups are handled; reconnect previously disconnected households to process them separately."},{"type":"p","text":"Deletion requires the current Apple Account, a network connection, and iCloud Drive. Failed cloud steps are not reported as complete. The app retains progress and pauses synchronization, backup, and automatic restoration until you retry successfully. Automatic backup remains off after completion until you explicitly enable it. Deletion does not delete your Apple Account."},{"type":"p","text":"When unbound, you may explicitly choose Clear This Device Only (Keep Cloud Data), without signing in to iCloud. This leaves personal cloud backups and previous households intact and pauses automatic restoration and backup until you explicitly re-enable the relevant functions."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Copies, choices, and policy updates"},{"type":"p","text":"Records remain until you delete individual items or complete the deletion flow above. Deleting an individual shared item does not automatically remove older personal backups. Copies on another member’s device, your other devices, exported files, system device backups, and service records Apple retains under legal requirements may remain and must be managed separately. Avoid importing deleted information again from old backups."},{"type":"p","text":"We do not sell your data or use it for advertising profiles. Use the app to manage permissions, export supported records, and edit or delete data. The app offers no independent online registration service for children. We update this page and its effective date when practices change. Contact support for help, and avoid emailing full identity documents, medical records, or financial records."}]},"shelflife":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"ShelfLife 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"更新日期：2026 年 10 月 28 日"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策说明 ShelfLife 如何处理家庭器物、购买记录、凭证、说明书和更换提醒。"},{"type":"h2","text":"ShelfLife 保存的信息"},{"type":"p","text":"ShelfLife 保存你录入或扫描的档案，包括器物名称、购买信息、退货与保修期限、序列号、备注、维修与耗材历史、周期维护计划和附件。使用理赔跟踪时，也会保存案件状态、保险公司、金额、联系人和跟进行动。资料会保存在设备本地；开启个人 iCloud 同步且 iCloud 与 CloudKit 可用时，SwiftData 会将资料同步到与你的 Apple 帐户关联的 ShelfLife 私有数据库。你可以在设置中暂停此自动同步，变更会在完全退出并重新启动 App 后生效。暂停不会删除本机资料或 iCloud 中已有副本；家庭共享由单独设置控制。开发者不运营接收这些档案的服务器。"},{"type":"p","text":"小票和产品铭牌识别使用设备上的 Apple Vision 框架，条码扫描和匹配也在本机完成，只查询少量已核实的离线目录。GS1 前缀表示条码分配机构所在地区，不代表商品产地。未匹配的条码会保存在档案中供你手动补全，不会发送到外部商品目录。图片、识别文字和条码不会发送到 ShelfLife 服务器。识别结果只作为草稿，你可以在保存前核对和修改。若你主动开启家庭共享，已保存的器物档案会包含在下文所述的 CloudKit 共享快照中。"},{"type":"h2","text":"Apple 服务与可选的提醒事项同步"},{"type":"p","text":"App Store 购买由 Apple 处理。ShelfLife 使用 StoreKit 判断 Pro 功能是否可用，不会收到银行卡或支付卡资料。"},{"type":"p","text":"语音建档需要麦克风和语音识别权限。开启“优先在线识别”时，音频会发送到 Apple 的语音服务处理；关闭时，ShelfLife 会在所选语言支持的情况下请求本机识别；所选语言不支持本机识别时，Apple 仍可能通过在线服务处理音频。识别文字会先作为草稿展示，只有你确认后才保存到资料库。"},{"type":"p","text":"如果你在设置中开启 Apple 提醒事项同步，ShelfLife 会申请完整提醒事项权限，以便在专属的“ShelfLife”列表中创建、更新和删除自己管理的提醒。它会同步已启用提醒的保修、耗材、维护、理赔跟进、库存保质期和借出归还任务。此权限为可选。关闭同步时，只会在权限仍可用的情况下移除 ShelfLife 管理的提醒；不会修改你的其他提醒。如果你已撤销权限，请在“提醒事项”App 中移除 ShelfLife 列表。"},{"type":"p","text":"获得通知权限后，ShelfLife 会在设备本地安排通知：最多登记最近 30 项保修、耗材、维护、库存保质期、借出归还和理赔跟进提醒，另有一项每年重复的年度体检提醒。"},{"type":"p","text":"家庭共享需要 ShelfLife Pro，是可选功能，仅在你主动从设置中开启后开始。它会将完整资料库（含附件、商品条码、序列号、维护计划、理赔案件和案件联系人）以快照形式存入你的 iCloud CloudKit 共享数据库。系统共享界面允许你邀请指定的 iCloud 成员，并赋予读写权限。ShelfLife 会在本机资料变更后和 App 处于前台时同步快照，并在临时网络故障后重试。不同资料按 ID 合并。如果共享快照与本机资料在上次同步后都发生了变化，ShelfLife 会询问相同 ID 的资料优先采用哪一边。删除会同步给其他成员；共享快照会保留最少的记录 ID 和删除日期，防止已删除资料再次出现。共享快照上限为 40 MB。开发者无法访问这些共享资料。"},{"type":"h2","text":"分享与导出"},{"type":"p","text":"ShelfLife 不包含广告追踪或开发者分析服务。新建的本地备份使用你设置的密码加密；ShelfLife 不保存或找回该密码。仍可导入旧版未加密 ZIP 备份。Excel、CSV 清单和 PDF 报告未加密，可能包含序列号、购买信息、备注和凭证。导出文件独立于 App 内资料；不再需要时请单独删除。家庭共享快照会保存在 CloudKit 并向受邀成员开放，不受本地备份密码保护。"},{"type":"h2","text":"保存期限与删除"},{"type":"p","text":"资料会一直保留到你删除为止。删除器物会同时删除关联耗材、历史记录和附件；CloudKit 同步可用时，删除也会同步到你的私有数据库。导出文件是独立副本，删除 ShelfLife 档案不会删除这些副本。"},{"type":"h2","text":"你的选择"},{"type":"p","text":"你可以离线使用 ShelfLife，在 ShelfLife 设置中暂停或恢复个人私有数据库同步，在 iOS 设置中控制通知权限，在 ShelfLife 设置中开启或关闭提醒事项同步，在 App 中删除档案，创建或恢复密码加密备份，也可以自行开启或管理家庭共享。个人同步变更会在完全退出并重新启动 App 后生效；暂停不会删除本机资料或 iCloud 中已有副本，家庭共享由单独设置控制。CloudKit 是否可用取决于 Apple 帐户、设备设置、网络和 iCloud 可用空间。如果你依赖这些资料，请保留一份最新备份。"},{"type":"h2","text":"联系方式"},{"type":"p","text":"如有隐私或使用问题，请联系支持团队：zipmaster_support@126.com，或通过 ShelfLife App Store 产品页面公布的支持联系方式联系。"},{"type":"h2","text":"政策更新"},{"type":"p","text":"如果 App 的数据处理方式发生变化，我们会在发布变更前更新本政策和日期。"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"ShelfLife Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Last updated: October 28, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"This policy describes how ShelfLife handles household inventory, purchase records, receipts, manuals, and replacement reminders."},{"type":"h2","text":"Information stored by ShelfLife"},{"type":"p","text":"ShelfLife stores the records you enter or scan, including item names, purchase details, return and warranty deadlines, serial numbers, notes, service and consumable history, recurring maintenance plans, and attachments. If you use claim tracking, it also stores claim status, insurer, claim amounts, contact details, and follow-up actions. The app keeps a local copy on your device. When personal iCloud sync is enabled and iCloud and CloudKit are available, SwiftData syncs records to ShelfLife's CloudKit private database associated with your Apple Account. You can pause this automatic sync in Settings; the change takes effect after you fully quit and relaunch the app. Pausing does not remove the local data or existing iCloud copies. Household sharing is controlled separately. The developer does not operate a server that receives these records."},{"type":"p","text":"Receipt and product-label recognition uses Apple's Vision frameworks on your device. Barcode scanning and lookup also run on-device against a small verified catalog. The GS1 prefix identifies the region that assigned the code, not where the product was made. Unmatched codes are saved for manual completion and are not sent to an external product catalog. Images, recognized text, and barcodes are not sent to a ShelfLife server. Recognition results are drafts; you can review and edit them before saving. If you opt into household sharing, saved item records are included in the shared CloudKit snapshot described below."},{"type":"h2","text":"Apple services and optional Reminders sync"},{"type":"p","text":"Apple processes in-app purchases through the App Store. ShelfLife uses StoreKit to determine whether Pro features are available; it does not receive payment-card details."},{"type":"p","text":"Voice entry requires microphone and speech-recognition permission. When “Prefer online recognition” is enabled, audio is sent to Apple's speech service for processing. When it is disabled, ShelfLife requests on-device recognition where the selected language supports it; Apple may still process audio through its online service for languages without on-device support. The recognized text is shown as a draft and is saved to your library only after you confirm it."},{"type":"p","text":"If you turn on Apple Reminders sync in Settings, ShelfLife requests full Reminders access so it can create, update, and remove only its own reminders in a dedicated “ShelfLife” list. It syncs enabled warranty, consumable, maintenance, claim follow-up, inventory expiry, and loan return reminders. This permission is optional. Turning sync off removes ShelfLife-managed reminders when access is still available; your other reminders are not modified. If permission has been revoked, remove the ShelfLife list in the Reminders app."},{"type":"p","text":"Local notifications are scheduled on your device when you grant notification permission. ShelfLife schedules no more than the nearest 30 upcoming warranty, consumable, maintenance, inventory expiry, loan return, and insurance claim follow-up reminders, plus one repeating yearly home check-up reminder."},{"type":"p","text":"Household sharing requires ShelfLife Pro, is optional, and starts only when you choose it in Settings. It stores a snapshot of your complete library in your iCloud CloudKit shared database, including attachments, product barcodes, serial numbers, maintenance plans, insurance claims, and claim contact details. The system sharing sheet lets you invite specific iCloud members with read and write access. ShelfLife syncs snapshots after local changes and while the app is in the foreground, and retries temporary network failures. Different records merge by ID. If the shared snapshot changed and the local library also changed since the last sync, ShelfLife asks which side to prioritize for matching record IDs before completing the merge. Deletions sync to other members; a small record ID and deletion date are retained in the shared snapshot so deleted records do not reappear. Household snapshots are limited to 40 MB. The developer does not receive the shared data."},{"type":"h2","text":"Sharing and exports"},{"type":"p","text":"ShelfLife contains no advertising tracker or developer analytics service. New local backups are encrypted with a password you choose; ShelfLife does not store or recover that password. Older plain ZIP backups can still be imported. Excel, CSV, and PDF exports are not encrypted and may contain serial numbers, purchase details, notes, and receipts. Exported files are separate from app data; delete them separately when they are no longer needed. Household snapshots are stored in CloudKit for the members you invite and are not protected by the local backup password."},{"type":"h2","text":"Retention and deletion"},{"type":"p","text":"Records remain in ShelfLife until you delete them. Deleting an item also deletes its associated consumables, history, and attachments; when CloudKit sync is available, the deletion syncs to your private database. Exported files are separate copies and are not deleted when a record is removed from ShelfLife."},{"type":"h2","text":"Your choices"},{"type":"p","text":"You can use ShelfLife offline, pause or resume personal private-database sync in ShelfLife Settings, control notification permission in iOS Settings, turn Reminders sync on or off in ShelfLife Settings, delete records in the app, create or restore a password-encrypted backup, and opt into or manage household sharing. Personal sync changes take effect after you fully quit and relaunch the app; pausing it does not delete local data or existing iCloud copies. Household sharing is controlled separately. CloudKit availability depends on your Apple Account, device settings, network, and available iCloud storage. Keep a current backup if you rely on your records."},{"type":"h2","text":"Contact"},{"type":"p","text":"For privacy questions or support, contact zipmaster_support@126.com or use the support contact published on ShelfLife's App Store product page."},{"type":"h2","text":"Policy updates"},{"type":"p","text":"If the app's data handling changes, this policy and its last-updated date will be revised before the change is released."}]},"droidbridge":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"DroidBridge 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 10 月 28 日"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策适用于 macOS 版 DroidBridge（安卓桥）及其可选的 Android 配套工具。DroidBridge 是一款原生 macOS 菜单栏应用，专注于在 Mac 与 Android 设备之间进行高速文件浏览、传输与无线挂载。本政策说明应用在本机处理的信息、数据存储位置以及您的控制权。在 GitHub Pages 上托管的宣传或支持页面适用 GitHub 的相关服务政策。"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策由 DroidBridge Team（DroidBridge 的开发者与维护者）发布。"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 应用在本机与设备间处理的信息"},{"type":"li","text":"文件与目录访问：应用仅访问您通过 macOS 文件选择器明确选取的本地目录、以及通过安全书签授权的同步文件夹。在安卓设备端，应用仅在设备解锁并授予 MTP、ADB 或 FTP/WebDAV 授权时，浏览与传输相应存储目录中的文件。所有文件均在 Mac 与设备两端直接收发，不经过任何开发者中转服务器或第三方云端存储。"},{"type":"li","text":"相册与媒体直拖：菜单栏面板展示安卓设备相册最新的照片或截图缩略图，以便您直接拖拽至 Mac 应用中。MTP 模式下仅读取媒体缩略图，避免全量下载大文件；本地相册缓存严格限制在 300 MiB 上限以内，且可随时自动或手动清理。"},{"type":"li","text":"传输历史与断点续传：为方便追踪传输状态与失败重试，应用在 Mac 本机保留最近完成、失败或取消的传输历史（最多 200 条），包括文件名、传输方向、文件大小、耗时与设备标识符。对于大文件传输中断，未完成数据保存在临时分片文件中，仅在校验通过后替换目标文件。您可在传输历史界面随时一键清空全部已完成记录。"},{"type":"li","text":"剪贴板双向同步：仅在您主动启用剪贴板同步并扫描配对二维码后生效。配对使用动态 256 位会话令牌，传输内容在局域网内端对端加密。当伴侣 App 退至后台或设备断开连接时，同步会自动暂停。剪贴板数据仅驻留在设备内存中，不保存至磁盘，亦不上传云端。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 传输协议与网络安全"},{"type":"p","text":"有线 USB 传输（MTP/ADB）完全在 Mac 与手机的本地物理总线或本地回环（127.0.0.1:5037）间完成，不产生任何外部互联网网络流量。"},{"type":"p","text":"局域网传输（FTP/WebDAV/网页快传）：应用利用 Bonjour 广播仅在当前局域网内发现本地设备。扫码快传支持带证书指纹校验的 HTTPS 伴侣二维码，以及适用于无客户端环境的 HTTP 浏览器门户。因传统 FTP 和未配置证书的 HTTP 属于明文传输，请勿将传输端口映射至公共互联网，建议仅在受信任的私人 Wi-Fi 环境中使用。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 凭据、权限与本地存储"},{"type":"li","text":"系统钥匙串（Keychain）：如果您选择保存连接 FTP 或 WebDAV 服务的密码凭据，该凭据将安全保存在 macOS 系统钥匙串中，享有系统级硬件加密保护，开发者无法接触。"},{"type":"li","text":"沙盒与安全书签：应用遵循 macOS 严格的应用沙盒机制，仅通过系统标准安全范围书签（Security-Scoped Bookmark）持久化保存您选定的同步目录访问权限。"},{"type":"li","text":"无广告与第三方分析：DroidBridge 不包含任何商业广告 SDK、第三方追踪器、数据统计或用户画像分析组件。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 内购与 StoreKit 处理"},{"type":"p","text":"DroidBridge Pro 的购买、订阅与恢复均通过 Apple StoreKit 2 由 Apple 官方处理。交易与账单信息由 Apple 按照其隐私政策妥善处理，DroidBridge 不收集亦不存储任何支付卡号或财务信息。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 数据保留与彻底删除"},{"type":"p","text":"连接历史、偏好设置和同步任务仅保存在您的 Mac 本地。您可以随时在应用设置与传输面板中清除传输历史与临时缓存；卸载应用并清理本地应用数据即可完全抹除。保存在钥匙串中的连接凭据可随时通过 macOS“钥匙串访问”手动移除。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 儿童隐私与政策变更"},{"type":"p","text":"本应用不面向儿童收集任何个人信息，亦不设用户注册账号体系。若应用的功能更新涉及数据处理政策的调整，我们将在本页面更新生效日期并公示最新说明。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 联系支持"},{"type":"p","text":"如果您对本隐私政策或数据处理有任何疑问，请联系我们：zipmaster_support@126.com。"},{"type":"p","text":"© 2026 DroidBridge Team. 产品首页 · 隐私政策 · 技术支持与反馈"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"DroidBridge Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective date: October 28, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"This privacy policy applies to DroidBridge for macOS and its optional Android companion tools. DroidBridge is a native macOS menu bar application designed for fast Android file browsing, transfer, and wireless mounting. This policy explains what information the app processes locally, where data is stored, and the controls available to you. Marketing or support webpages hosted on GitHub Pages are subject to GitHub's applicable privacy terms."},{"type":"p","text":"This policy is published by the DroidBridge Team, the developers and maintainers of DroidBridge."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Information Processed Locally and Between Devices"},{"type":"li","text":"Files and Folders: The app accesses only the local directories you explicitly select through standard macOS file pickers and security-scoped bookmarks. On connected Android devices, DroidBridge browses and transfers files only within the storage authorized via MTP, ADB, or FTP/WebDAV. All files transfer directly between your Mac and devices without routing through any developer relay servers or third-party cloud storage."},{"type":"li","text":"Recent Photos and Media Preview: The menu bar panel displays thumbnails of the latest photos and screenshots from your Android device for instant drag-and-drop into Mac apps. Under MTP mode, only thumbnails are retrieved to avoid downloading entire media files; local thumbnail caches are capped at 300 MiB and can be cleared at any time."},{"type":"li","text":"Transfer History and Resumable Transfers: To provide transfer status and failure recovery, DroidBridge keeps a local history of up to 200 recent completed, failed, or cancelled transfers (recording file names, direction, size, elapsed time, and device identifiers). Interrupted large transfers store incomplete parts in hidden sidecar files and replace target files only upon full verification. You can clear finished transfer logs at any time."},{"type":"li","text":"Two-Way Clipboard Sync: Operates only when you explicitly pair via QR code. Pairing uses dynamic 256-bit session tokens with end-to-end encryption across your local network. Sync automatically pauses when the companion app goes to the background or when disconnected. Clipboard text resides in volatile memory and is never written to disk or uploaded to any cloud server."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Transmission Protocols and Network Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Wired USB transfers (MTP and ADB) run entirely across the local physical USB bus or loopback socket (127.0.0.1:5037), generating no external internet traffic."},{"type":"p","text":"Local Network Transfers (FTP, WebDAV, QR Web Drop): The app uses Bonjour solely for local device discovery within your local network. QR Web Drop provides HTTPS companion transfer with certificate fingerprint verification, alongside an unencrypted browser portal. Because traditional FTP and unencrypted HTTP transmit in plain text, do not expose ports to the public internet, and use these transfers only on trusted private Wi-Fi networks."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Credentials, Permissions, and Local Storage"},{"type":"li","text":"macOS Keychain: If you choose to save login credentials for FTP or WebDAV servers, they are stored securely in macOS Keychain with system-level hardware protection. The developer has no access to your credentials."},{"type":"li","text":"App Sandbox and Security Bookmarks: DroidBridge adheres strictly to the macOS App Sandbox, retaining folder access permissions exclusively through user-granted security-scoped bookmarks."},{"type":"li","text":"No Ads or Tracking SDKs: The app contains no advertising SDKs, commercial trackers, user profiling, or third-party behavioral analytics."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. In-App Purchases and StoreKit"},{"type":"p","text":"Purchases and subscription restorations for DroidBridge Pro are handled directly by Apple through StoreKit 2. Apple processes transactions under its own privacy policy. DroidBridge does not receive or store any credit card numbers or financial details."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Data Retention and Erasure"},{"type":"p","text":"Connection history, preferences, and saved sync tasks remain on your Mac. You can clear recent transfer logs and caches inside the app. Deleting the application and its local data directories completely wipes all local files. Saved server passwords can be removed from macOS Keychain Access at any time."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Children's Privacy and Policy Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"DroidBridge does not solicit or collect personal information from children and does not operate online user registration accounts. If data handling practices change, we will update the effective date on this page."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have questions or feedback regarding this privacy policy, please contact us at: zipmaster_support@126.com."},{"type":"p","text":"© 2026 DroidBridge Team. Product Home · Privacy Policy · Support & Help"}]},"dropsqueeze":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"DropSqueeze 隐私政策与数据保护声明"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 10 月 28 日"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 核心架构与端侧原则"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze 是一款专为 macOS 设计的极速静默媒体压缩与格式转换工具。我们坚信用户的数据所有权与个人隐私至关重要，因此应用采用了纯端侧（On-Device）无云端零上传架构。所有图片、视频、动态 GIF 及 PDF 文件的无损/有损压缩、硬件转码、EXIF/GPS 元数据抹除及端侧 Vision 文本识别全部 100% 在你的 Mac 本地硬件完成。"},{"type":"p","text":"开发者不设立也不运营任何用于收集、存储或分析用户媒体数据的后端服务器，应用中未集成任何第三方数据分析、统计、行为跟踪或商业广告 SDK。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 剪贴板监听与数据保护"},{"type":"p","text":"当你开启剪贴板监控功能时，应用仅在后台周期性检查 macOS 系统剪贴板计数器 NSPasteboard.changeCount。仅当检测到剪贴板中出现新的图像数据或受支持的音视频文件 URL 时，应用才会在本地执行压缩算法。"},{"type":"p","text":"压缩完成后，仅在生成的新文件体积确实小于原始体积时，才将优化后的副本安全写回剪贴板；若压缩后体积未缩减，则保持原剪贴板内容不变。"},{"type":"p","text":"为了防止剪贴板写入引发死循环处理，DropSqueeze 在写回时会附带自定义私有内部标记（Private Marker）。该标记仅供 DropSqueeze 自身识别且不包含任何个人身份信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"剪贴板历史收集条（Collection Bar）最多保留最近 12 项媒体，纯驻留在易失性会话内存中，退出应用或点击清空时即刻销毁，绝不写入本地磁盘或外部存储。你可随时在设置中完全关闭剪贴板监控。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 文件夹自动化监控与沙盒安全"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze 严格遵循 macOS App Sandbox 沙盒规范。当你添加需要自动监控的截图或录屏目录（例如桌面或自定义下载目录）时，需通过 macOS 官方 NSOpenPanel 显式授权。应用仅通过系统提供的安全作用域书签（Security-Scoped Bookmarks）在本地保存授权，以便在重启后恢复监控。"},{"type":"p","text":"在自动监控过程中，DropSqueeze 严格遵循非破坏性原则，绝不擅自覆盖、修改或删除你的原始源文件。压缩产物默认作为独立副本保存在同级目录下，或输出至你所指定的专用输出目录中。"},{"type":"p","text":"你可以随时在设置中暂停监控、删除文件夹监控规则，或撤销已授权的目录访问书签。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 隐私元数据剥离与脱敏"},{"type":"p","text":"数码照片与截图中常常包含拍摄设备型号、镜头参数、拍摄时间、地理位置经纬度（GPS）及私人注释。DropSqueeze 提供主动隐私脱敏保护，在压缩 JPEG、HEIC、WebP 等图片时，可配置为自动彻底抹除所有 EXIF、GPS 拍摄地点及隐私元数据，避免在社交平台、即时通讯或公共网络共享时泄露真实物理位置与设备信息。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 本地数据存储与管理"},{"type":"p","text":"应用在本机仅通过 macOS UserDefaults 存储必要的使用偏好与统计信息，包括："},{"type":"li","text":"用户自定义的压缩参数、分辨率缩放规则、自动化食谱及监控文件夹书签；"},{"type":"li","text":"每日免费额度计数器（每天在本地自动重置）；"},{"type":"li","text":"累计节省磁盘空间与最近压缩历史记录（仅记录文件名、处理时间、压缩前后体积及比率）。"},{"type":"p","text":"上述所有数据均保留在你的 Mac 本地，不会向任何网络云端同步。你随时可以在“设置”中点击“清空历史记录”，彻底删除所有本地压缩活动记录与累计统计。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 应用内购买与 Apple StoreKit"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze 提供的 Pro 年度订阅与终身买断制功能通过 Apple StoreKit 2 官方系统框架完成。"},{"type":"p","text":"所有付款处理、交易验证及订阅管理均由 Apple 官方服务器直接执行。开发者不收集、不访问且不存储任何信用卡号、银行账户或 Apple ID 凭据。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 系统权限与扩展功能"},{"type":"p","text":"系统通知（可选）：仅用于在后台静默压缩完成时展示节省空间提示与快捷撤销操作，用户可随时在系统设置中关闭通知。"},{"type":"p","text":"快捷指令与 App Intents（可选）：提供“压缩媒体文件”快捷指令动作，供用户在系统快捷指令或 Finder 快速操作中调用，执行过程同样受限于系统沙盒保护，不会上传数据。"},{"type":"h2","text":"8. 数据保留、删除与用户权利"},{"type":"p","text":"本地数据完全由你控制。卸载 DropSqueeze 并清除其沙盒容器即可彻底删除所有本地关联数据。"},{"type":"h2","text":"9. 联系我们"},{"type":"p","text":"如对本隐私政策、数据处理或应用功能有任何疑问，请联系技术支持团队："},{"type":"p","text":"支持邮箱：zipmaster_support@126.com"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"DropSqueeze Privacy Policy & Data Protection Declaration"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective Date: October 28, 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Core Architecture & Local-First Principle"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze is a macOS utility engineered for silent media compression, image/video optimization, and format transcoding. We firmly believe that user privacy and data ownership are fundamental. The application is built entirely on an on-device, local-first architecture. All lossy and lossless compression, hardware-accelerated video encoding, EXIF/GPS metadata stripping, and on-device Vision OCR take place 100% locally on your Mac."},{"type":"p","text":"We do not operate developer servers to collect, upload, or analyze your media files. DropSqueeze contains zero third-party telemetry, behavioral analytics, ad networks, or tracking SDKs."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Clipboard Monitoring & Safety Guards"},{"type":"p","text":"When clipboard monitoring is enabled, DropSqueeze periodically inspects the system clipboard counter (NSPasteboard.changeCount). The app processes content only when new image data or supported media file URLs are detected."},{"type":"p","text":"Once compression completes, the optimized copy is safely written back to the clipboard only if a genuine reduction in file size was achieved. If the compressed result is not smaller, the original clipboard content remains unchanged."},{"type":"p","text":"To prevent recursive infinite processing loops, DropSqueeze tags processed clipboard items with a private marker that is recognized solely by DropSqueeze and contains no personal identity data."},{"type":"p","text":"The clipboard collection bar retains up to 12 recent items purely within volatile session memory. It is cleared upon quitting the application or manual reset, and is never written to persistent disk storage. You may disable clipboard monitoring at any time in Settings."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Folder Automation & App Sandbox"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze strictly adheres to macOS App Sandbox security guidelines. When you configure watched directories (such as your Desktop or custom screenshot folders), access is granted explicitly via the macOS native NSOpenPanel. The app retains access permissions using security-scoped bookmarks stored locally on your device."},{"type":"p","text":"All compression workflows are strictly non-destructive. DropSqueeze never overwrites, alters, or deletes your source files. Output files are placed alongside the source or in your chosen destination folder as independent copies."},{"type":"p","text":"You can pause folder watching, update automation recipes, or revoke folder permissions at any time within the application settings."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Metadata Scrubbing & Privacy Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital photos and screenshots often contain sensitive metadata, including camera models, shooting timestamps, exposure parameters, and precise GPS location coordinates. DropSqueeze provides automated metadata scrubbing for JPEG, HEIC, and WebP outputs, allowing you to completely strip EXIF and location data before sharing media across networks or workplace channels."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Local Data Storage & Preferences"},{"type":"p","text":"The application stores only essential user preferences and operational counters locally in macOS UserDefaults:"},{"type":"li","text":"User-configured compression profiles, dimension scaling preferences, automation recipes, and security-scoped folder bookmarks;"},{"type":"li","text":"Daily free compression quotas (reset locally every day);"},{"type":"li","text":"Cumulative disk space savings and recent compression history (limited to file names, timestamps, before/after sizes, and savings ratios)."},{"type":"p","text":"None of this information is transmitted off your Mac. You can permanently erase all local activity history and statistics at any time via Settings -> History & Statistics -> Clear History."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. In-App Purchases & Apple StoreKit"},{"type":"p","text":"DropSqueeze Pro subscriptions and lifetime licenses are handled through Apple StoreKit 2."},{"type":"p","text":"All payment processing, entitlement verification, and subscription renewals are conducted directly between your device and Apple servers. The developer never receives, stores, or accesses your credit card information, billing details, or Apple ID credentials."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. System Permissions & App Intents"},{"type":"p","text":"System Notifications (Optional): Used solely to deliver local completion alerts with space savings figures and an undo action. Notifications can be configured or disabled in System Settings."},{"type":"p","text":"Shortcuts & App Intents (Optional): Provides the \"Compress Media Files\" action for macOS Shortcuts and Finder Quick Actions, operating under the same local sandbox boundaries without network transmission."},{"type":"h2","text":"8. Data Retention, Deletion & User Rights"},{"type":"p","text":"You maintain full control over your data. All records remain local to your Mac. Deleting the application and its application support container will completely erase all local data."},{"type":"h2","text":"9. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have any questions, feedback, or support inquiries regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to our team:"},{"type":"p","text":"Support Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"}]},"netpulse":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"NetPulse 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 11 月 7 日"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 适用范围与基本原则"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策适用于 iOS 与 iPadOS 版本的 NetPulse（包括随附的小组件），由 NetPulse 开发者发布。我们深知网络与硬件工程师在现场调试时对数据隐私与内网拓扑安全的极高要求。我们坚持“本地优先、零云端依赖、数据最小化”的原则。"},{"type":"p","text":"应用不提供独立的云端账户注册体系，不运营用于收集、存储或分析用户调试数据的自建服务器，未接入任何广告联盟、跨应用追踪（IDFA）或第三方统计 SDK。隐私与技术支持咨询请通过邮件联系：zipmaster_support@126.com。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 处理的数据与具体功能说明"},{"type":"p","text":"低功耗蓝牙（BLE & GATT）调试：应用扫描周边的低功耗蓝牙广播信号，解析广播名称、服务 UUID、厂商自定义数据（Manufacturer Data）、实时 RSSI 信号强度及发射功率。连接设备后，应用可按你的指令读取、写入或订阅 GATT 特征值与描述符。所有外设标识符均为 iOS CoreBluetooth 生成的本地随机 UUID，不暴露硬件原始 MAC 地址。蓝牙调试数据与交互历史仅保存在设备内存与受保护的本地存储中。"},{"type":"p","text":"固件更新与 DFU：在执行 Nordic OTA DFU 或 MCUboot/MCUmgr 升级时，应用仅在用户主动从系统文件选择器选取本地固件包（.bin, .zip, .suit）并在确认后，通过蓝牙直接推流到所选外设。固件文件在升级流程关闭后从受保护临时沙盒中自动销毁。"},{"type":"p","text":"局域网设备发现与网络诊断：应用利用 mDNS/Bonjour、SSDP (UPnP) 及局域网广播发现本地活跃的物联网设备、NAS、打印机及摄像头；提供 ICMP Ping 延迟监测、UDP 路由追踪（Traceroute）及针对用户指定目标的常用端口开放性探测（如 80、443、554 等）。所有网络扫描仅在当前连入的本地 Wi-Fi 或有线网络子网中进行，绝不向任何外部服务器上传局域网资产清单或网络拓扑。"},{"type":"p","text":"路由器邻居表（IP-MAC 映射）：仅当你手动输入最多 4 台本地/私有数字 IP 地址的路由器时，应用通过只读 SNMP 查询路由器的标准接口邻居表。路由器登录凭据（Community 或 SNMPv3 凭据）仅临时保存在设备内存中，停止监测或离开页面时立即清空，不进行磁盘持久化。"},{"type":"p","text":"ONVIF 摄像头与 RTSP 视频流：应用通过 WS-Discovery 协议自动发现局域网摄像头。在用户输入凭据后，通过标准 ONVIF 接口拉取媒体配置与 RTSP 流地址。实时音视频流通过设备内置播放器直接与局域网摄像头建立 RTSP/RTSPS 点对点传输解码播放，视频流绝不经过任何第三方云端服务器中转。摄像头访问凭据保存在本地钥匙串或受保护沙盒中。"},{"type":"p","text":"摄像头双向对讲（Talkback）：仅在你主动开启双向音频对讲时，应用才会请求麦克风权限采集实时人声，并以标准音频流格式推流至本地摄像头扬声器。音频数据实时推流，不录音、不保存、不上传云端，对讲停止后即刻释放麦克风。"},{"type":"p","text":"网络带宽与延迟测速：应用内置官方测速模块，直接向 Cloudflare 全球公用测速节点发送标准测试流量，计算下行/上行带宽、空闲延迟及抖动。测速仅在用户主动点击“开始测速”时进行，应用不向测速服务器附带任何 Wi-Fi 密码、内网 IP、设备唯一标识等隐私信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"DNS 查询与局域网唤醒：系统 DNS 与 DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) 查询仅在用户发起时向相应解析服务器发送域名查询；Wake-on-LAN 仅向本地广播域发送 Magic Packet。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 系统权限申请与使用目的"},{"type":"p","text":"蓝牙权限（NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription）：用于扫描低功耗蓝牙外设、读取广播数据、连接外设调试 GATT 特征值以及在前台模拟外设广播。不用于推测地理位置。"},{"type":"p","text":"本地网络权限（NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription）：iOS 系统要求访问本地局域网（Bonjour、SSDP、ONVIF 多播、端口探测、RTSP 视频取流、前台 SNMP 接收）必须获得该权限。NetPulse 不会滥用该权限扫描与应用功能无关的内网隐私。"},{"type":"p","text":"麦克风权限（NSMicrophoneUsageDescription）：仅在主动触发摄像头双向对讲功能时实时采集语音，直接推流给局域网摄像头，不进行录制或上传。"},{"type":"p","text":"本地通知权限：可选开启。仅在前台运行时针对用户设置的阈值（如连续 Ping 超时、ONVIF 移动侦测事件）弹出本地通知。应用不注册 APNs 远程推送服务。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 数据存储、安全保护与导出边界"},{"type":"p","text":"本地安全存储：收藏的设备别名、调试宏、测速历史、Ping 历史等保存在应用专属的沙盒容器中，并设置排除在系统 iCloud 云端常规备份之外（isExcludedFromBackup），确保内网敏感数据不被自动上传到云端备份。"},{"type":"p","text":"安全导出机制：当用户主动分享或导出 CSV 报表或 JSON 快照时，应用在受系统高保护等级（NSFileProtectionComplete）的临时目录生成文件，并在分享面板关闭后自动彻底删除。所有 CSV 均实施严格的公式注入防护，对可能被电子表格软件执行的特殊前缀字符进行转义。"},{"type":"p","text":"凭据安全：敏感凭据（如摄像头密码、SNMP 访问凭据）均安全存储于设备本地钥匙串或仅保存在运行时内存中；在导出任何报表或日志时，所有凭据字段均会被自动剥离，防止意外泄露。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 网络通信与第三方服务边界"},{"type":"p","text":"除了用户主动发起的“Cloudflare 网络测速”、公共 DoH 域名解析以及 Apple App Store 应用内购买校验外，NetPulse 不会向任何外部公网服务器发起静默网络请求。"},{"type":"p","text":"应用不含任何第三方广告联盟 SDK、行为统计分析 SDK 或社交分享组件。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 数据的保留、清除与用户权利"},{"type":"p","text":"历史记录清理：你可以在应用内的各个功能页面（测速历史、Ping 历史、BLE 扫描记录、SNMP 记录、摄像头列表）随时主动清除单条或全部记录与缓存。"},{"type":"p","text":"完全清除：删除（卸载）NetPulse 应用将立即彻底清除设备沙盒与钥匙串中由本应用存储的所有配置文件、历史记录及凭据。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 儿童隐私与政策更新"},{"type":"p","text":"本应用面向硬件与网络专业技术人员，不针对 13 岁（或你所在司法辖区规定的儿童年龄）以下儿童。我们不会故意收集儿童的任何个人信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"随着应用功能的迭代或相关法律法规的变化，我们可能会适时更新本隐私政策。更新后的政策将发布于本网页，并在政策开头注明最新生效日期。"},{"type":"h2","text":"8. 联系支持团队"},{"type":"p","text":"如果你对 NetPulse 的隐私实践、权限使用或技术支持有任何疑问，请联系我们：zipmaster_support@126.com。来信时请提供 iOS 系统版本、应用版本及问题描述，切勿在邮件中附带你的密码、私钥或内网敏感凭据。"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"NetPulse Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective Date: November 7, 2026"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Scope and Core Principles"},{"type":"p","text":"This Privacy Policy applies to the iOS and iPadOS versions of NetPulse (including accompanying widgets), published by the NetPulse developer. We understand the paramount importance of data confidentiality and network topology safety for field engineers, IoT developers, and network administrators. We strictly adhere to an On-Device First, Zero Cloud Dependency, and Data Minimization architecture."},{"type":"p","text":"NetPulse does not require account registration, does not operate proprietary backend servers to capture diagnostic data, and contains no advertising, cross-app tracking (IDFA), or commercial analytics SDKs. For privacy inquiries or support, contact zipmaster_support@126.com."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Handled Data and Functionality Details"},{"type":"p","text":"Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE & GATT) Debugging: NetPulse scans nearby BLE advertisements, parsing advertised names, Service UUIDs, Manufacturer Data, live RSSI signal curves, and Tx Power. Upon connecting to a peripheral, the app reads, writes, and subscribes to GATT characteristics and descriptors according to your instructions. Peripheral identifiers are device-local random UUIDs generated by iOS CoreBluetooth, avoiding exposure of raw hardware MAC addresses. Debug logs and signal samples reside solely in memory and protected local storage."},{"type":"p","text":"Firmware Updates and DFU: During Nordic Legacy/Secure DFU or MCUboot/MCUmgr SMP updates, firmware packages (.bin, .zip, .suit) are accessed strictly through explicit system document selection and user confirmation. Package data is transmitted directly to the peripheral over BLE, and temporary staging files are purged upon closing the update interface."},{"type":"p","text":"LAN Discovery and Network Diagnostics: The app utilizes mDNS/Bonjour, SSDP (UPnP), and local subnet sweeps to discover active IoT devices, printers, NAS, and cameras. It provides ICMP Ping latency monitoring, UDP traceroute, and targeted TCP port checks (such as 80, 443, 554, 8080). All discovery takes place strictly within your connected local Wi-Fi or wired network; device inventories and network topologies are never transmitted to external servers."},{"type":"p","text":"Router Neighbor Discovery (SNMP): When you explicitly specify up to 4 local/private router IP addresses, the app queries standard IP-MIB and legacy interface neighbor tables via read-only SNMP. Router credentials (SNMP Community or v3 credentials) remain exclusively in volatile memory and are cleared immediately upon exiting the tool or terminating monitoring."},{"type":"p","text":"ONVIF Cameras and RTSP Live Feeds: NetPulse auto-discovers network cameras via WS-Discovery. Upon credential entry, it retrieves media profiles and RTSP stream URIs via standard ONVIF APIs. Live video streams directly from the camera to the on-device player over point-to-point RTSP/RTSPS. Camera streams are never proxied or forwarded through third-party servers. Credentials are stored securely in local Keychain or protected app storage."},{"type":"p","text":"Two-Way Talkback Audio: Microphone access is requested only when you actively trigger camera talkback. Audio is captured in real time and pushed directly to the local camera over RTSP using standard codecs. Audio is never recorded, never stored on disk, and never routed to cloud infrastructure."},{"type":"p","text":"Speed Tests and Latency Checks: The app integrates the official Cloudflare speed-test module to measure download/upload bandwidth, idle latency, and jitter. Network test traffic is sent directly to Cloudflare edge nodes only when you tap Start Test. NetPulse never includes local network names, internal IP addresses, or device identifiers in test requests."},{"type":"p","text":"DNS Queries and Wake-on-LAN: System DNS and DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) lookups query specified public resolvers only on request. Wake-on-LAN transmits standard Magic Packets only across the local broadcast domain."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. System Permissions and Usage Justifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Bluetooth Permission (NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription): Required to scan for BLE peripherals, read advertising data, connect to GATT services, and optionally broadcast simulated peripheral profiles in the foreground. Never used for geographic location tracking."},{"type":"p","text":"Local Network Permission (NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription): Required by iOS to discover local Bonjour/mDNS, SSDP, and ONVIF devices, perform port probes and Ping checks, stream RTSP video, and listen for foreground SNMP notifications. NetPulse never abuses this permission to harvest private network metadata."},{"type":"p","text":"Microphone Permission (NSMicrophoneUsageDescription): Used strictly during active camera talkback sessions to transmit live voice to the local camera. Audio is never stored or recorded."},{"type":"p","text":"Local Notifications: Optional. Used solely in the foreground to notify you of user-configured thresholds (such as consecutive Ping packet loss or camera motion alerts). No remote APNs tokens are registered or collected."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Data Storage, Security and Safe Export"},{"type":"p","text":"Protected Local Storage: Saved device aliases, macros, speed-test logs, and Ping histories reside in the app sandboxed container and are explicitly marked as excluded from iCloud backup (isExcludedFromBackup), ensuring local network data is never pushed to cloud backups."},{"type":"p","text":"Secure Export Mechanisms: User-initiated CSV or JSON report exports are generated inside complete file protection (NSFileProtectionComplete) temporary directories and permanently wiped once the system share sheet is dismissed. Exported CSV files include strict spreadsheet formula injection mitigation."},{"type":"p","text":"Credential Separation: Camera passwords and SNMP community strings are stored in the device Keychain or volatile memory only, and are stripped from all exported diagnostic files to prevent accidental disclosure."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Network Communication and Third-Party Services"},{"type":"p","text":"Except for user-initiated Cloudflare speed tests, public DoH queries, and standard Apple App Store receipt validation, NetPulse makes no network requests outside your local network."},{"type":"p","text":"The application contains no commercial ad networks, third-party user analytics SDKs, or social sharing components."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Data Retention, Deletion and User Rights"},{"type":"p","text":"Selective Deletion: You can clear individual or all history entries, logs, and saved camera profiles at any time directly within the respective tool screens."},{"type":"p","text":"Complete Removal: Deleting NetPulse from your device immediately and permanently deletes all sandboxed databases, Keychain credentials, and local cache."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Children's Privacy and Policy Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"NetPulse is designed for engineering and network professionals and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children."},{"type":"p","text":"We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect app enhancements or legal requirements. Updated policies will be posted on this page with a revised effective date."},{"type":"h2","text":"8. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or NetPulse technical support, contact us at zipmaster_support@126.com. Please include your iOS version, app version, and question details; do not include passwords or confidential network credentials in your correspondence."}]},"luxframe":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"LuxFrame 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"更新日期：2026 年 11 月 7 日"},{"type":"p","text":"本政策说明 LuxFrame（光影暗盒）及其配套小组件与 Apple Watch 应用如何处理测光数据、胶卷暗盒记录、冲扫元数据、设备传感器与系统权限。"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 核心原则与联系方式"},{"type":"p","text":"LuxFrame 专为胶片摄影师、大画幅玩家与暗房创作者设计。我们坚守本地优先（Local-First）与零跟踪原则：应用不提供独立用户注册系统，不运营任何用于收集用户资料的自建服务器，也未集成任何第三方分析、广告营销或跨应用追踪 SDK。任何疑问请联系技术支持邮箱：zipmaster_support@126.com。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. LuxFrame 处理的数据与用途"},{"type":"p","text":"测光与曝光参数：实时 EV100、光圈、快门速度、ISO 感光度、近似色温（Kelvin）估算、滤镜补偿倍率以及区域曝光法（Zone System）阶调锚定数据均在设备端实时计算并临时呈现，仅当你点击“记录一帧”时才会固化到当前胶卷暗盒中。"},{"type":"p","text":"胶卷暗盒记录本：包含你创建的胶卷型号（如 Kodak Portra、Ilford HP5 Plus 等片基预设）、相机机身与镜头档案、单帧曝光参数、现场快照参考图与可选的语音备忘录。全部数据使用 SwiftData 安全保存在设备本地沙盒中。"},{"type":"p","text":"底片冲扫与 EXIF 注入：导入冲扫店的数字扫描件（JPG/TIFF）后，LuxFrame 利用系统原生 ImageIO 框架完全在本地批量将拍摄时的机身、镜头、光圈、快门与 GPS 坐标写入图像 EXIF/TIFF 元数据中；负片反转实验室的色彩与正像预览仅在本地图形着色器内存中渲染，不修改原始文件。"},{"type":"p","text":"机械快门测速音频：启动机械快门声音测试时，应用通过麦克风拾取快门释放的机械声响，仅在当前测试界面的活跃内存（RAM）中进行最多 8 秒的瞬时 RMS 波形包络分析并估算开闭时长。测试完成后内存音频数据立即释放，原始录音绝不写入磁盘，更不会向网络传输。"},{"type":"p","text":"外拍光学与天文工具：景深、超焦距、针孔等效曝光、大画幅沙姆定律视场、日升日落与黄金时刻等计算均基于经典光学公式与离线天文星历在本地运算。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 系统权限与设备传感器使用边界"},{"type":"p","text":"相机（NSCameraUsageDescription）：用于实时反射光测光、入射光校准估算、AR 日照路径叠加、底片正像透看，以及手动拍摄单帧数码参考图。日照实景路径只处理相机实时预览画面，不录像也不自动拍照；拍摄的底片参考图仅保存在 App 内部容器中，不自动同步到系统照片图库。"},{"type":"p","text":"麦克风（NSMicrophoneUsageDescription）：仅当你主动录制胶卷单帧现场语音备忘或启动机械快门测速工具时请求麦克风。快门检测音频仅在内存中瞬时分析，测试记录仅保存测得的时间毫秒数与相机机身标识，原始录音绝不落盘。"},{"type":"p","text":"位置权限（NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription）：仅在应用处于前台且你主动使用相关功能时按需读取。用途包括：搜索附近胶片冲洗店与暗房工坊、计算当前坐标的日出日落与黄金时刻、AR 日照实景路径对齐真北，以及记录胶片单帧时可选附带 GPS 经纬度。应用绝不进行后台位置追踪。"},{"type":"p","text":"照片图库（NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription 与 NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription）：仅当你主动选择从相册导入扫描件注入 EXIF，或将处理后的 EXIF 扫描件与校正正片保存至系统相册（例如专属的“LuxFrame EXIF”或“LuxFrame 正片”相册）时请求权限。"},{"type":"p","text":"设备动作与姿态（NSMotionUsageDescription）：仅在取景器开启时读取设备水平陀螺仪姿态，以在画面中绘制水平仪与俯仰辅助线。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. 数据存储、备份与 Apple iCloud 私有同步"},{"type":"p","text":"数据默认仅保存在本机。当你开启 iCloud 备份与多设备同步时，LuxFrame 利用 Apple CloudKit 私有数据库在你的同账号 iPhone、iPad 与 Apple Watch 之间安全同步，传输与存储均由 Apple 加密保障，开发者无法解密或查看任何内容。"},{"type":"p","text":"应用支持导出完整的未加密或带密码的高强度 AES-GCM 加密备份文件（.luxframebackup），支持导出胶卷 CSV 清单、GPX 轨迹文件与 HTML 接触印相样张。导出的文件完全由你自由支配与管理。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. App 内购买与支付"},{"type":"p","text":"LuxFrame Pro 的购买与订阅通过 Apple 官方 StoreKit 框架处理。所有付款流程均在 Apple App Store 安全沙盒内完成，开发者不会收集、处理或存储你的信用卡号、账单地址或 Apple ID 密码。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 保存期限、数据清除与权限撤销"},{"type":"p","text":"你的胶卷暗盒历史与相机配置将持续保留在设备上，直到你手动删除特定单帧、整卷胶卷，或在“设置 → 隐私与安全”中选择“彻底清空所有数据”。卸载 App 将同时删除本地沙盒中的所有数据与临时缓存。"},{"type":"p","text":"你可以随时在 iOS“设置 → LuxFrame”中随时关闭相机、麦克风、位置或照片图库权限，关闭后仅影响对应功能，核心计算与离线工具不受影响。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. 政策更新与技术支持"},{"type":"p","text":"如应用功能或相关法律要求发生变更，我们会在本页面公布最新政策与生效日期。如有任何隐私疑虑或改进建议，请联系：zipmaster_support@126.com。"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"LuxFrame Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective Date: November 7, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"This policy explains how LuxFrame, its widgets, and its Apple Watch companion handle exposure metering, film roll journals, lab scan metadata, hardware sensors, and system permissions."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Core Principles and Contact"},{"type":"p","text":"LuxFrame is designed for film photographers, large-format artists, and darkroom practitioners. We adhere strictly to an offline-first and zero-tracking philosophy: LuxFrame operates no user accounts, runs no proprietary cloud servers to collect user assets, and integrates no third-party telemetry, advertising, or cross-app tracking SDKs. For questions or support, email zipmaster_support@126.com."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Data Handled by LuxFrame and Purposes"},{"type":"p","text":"Light Metering and Exposure: Real-time EV100, aperture, shutter speed, ISO, approximate Kelvin white-balance references, filter compensation factors, and Zone System tonal anchors are computed locally on-device and rendered in real time. They are only saved when you explicitly record an exposure frame into your active film roll."},{"type":"p","text":"Film Roll Journal: Stores film stocks (Kodak Portra, Ilford HP5 Plus, etc.), camera and lens profiles, per-frame exposure settings, digital reference photos, and optional voice memos. All records are stored securely in your device sandbox using SwiftData."},{"type":"p","text":"Scans and Batch EXIF Injection: When importing digital scans (JPG/TIFF) from your lab, LuxFrame uses Apple’s native ImageIO framework to write shooting parameters (camera, lens, focal length, aperture, shutter, ISO, GPS coordinates) directly into EXIF/TIFF metadata on-device. Negative lab inversion previews run in local GPU shader memory without altering original files."},{"type":"p","text":"Mechanical Shutter Audio Tester: When running the shutter speed tester, the app samples audio of the mechanical shutter click via the microphone. An RMS waveform envelope is analyzed purely in volatile memory (RAM) for up to 8 seconds to measure curtain opening and closing intervals. The raw audio buffer is immediately freed upon completion and is never written to disk or transmitted over the network."},{"type":"p","text":"Optical and Celestial Tools: Depth of field, hyperfocal distance, pinhole equivalent exposure, large-format Scheimpflug view camera movements, and solar/lunar ephemeris calculate locally using offline astronomical formulas and optical algorithms."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. System Permissions and Sensor Boundaries"},{"type":"p","text":"Camera (NSCameraUsageDescription): Used for real-time reflective metering, incident calibration estimates, AR solar path overlays, live negative inversion preview, and capturing digital reference photos. AR solar path only processes live viewfinder frames without capturing still photos or video. Reference photos stay within the app container and are not automatically saved to the system Photos library."},{"type":"p","text":"Microphone (NSMicrophoneUsageDescription): Only requested when you explicitly record a voice memo for a frame or launch the audio shutter speed tester. Shutter audio is analyzed strictly in memory; only the resulting speed in milliseconds is logged."},{"type":"p","text":"Location Services (NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription): Requested on-demand only while the app is active in the foreground to: search nearby film processing labs, calculate sunrise/sunset/golden hour ephemeris, align AR sun path with true north, and optionally geotag recorded film frames. Background location tracking is never performed."},{"type":"p","text":"Photo Library (NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription & NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription): Requested only when you explicitly select lab scans to import for EXIF tagging, or save tagged scans and inverted negatives into dedicated Photos library albums (e.g. \"LuxFrame EXIF\" or \"LuxFrame Positives\")."},{"type":"p","text":"Device Motion (NSMotionUsageDescription): Used solely while the viewfinder is active to display real-time level and pitch guidelines."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. Storage, Backups, and Apple iCloud Sync"},{"type":"p","text":"Data is stored locally by default. When you choose to enable iCloud backup and sync, records synchronize across your devices via Apple CloudKit private databases associated with your personal Apple Account. Data is encrypted in transit and at rest by Apple; the developer has no access to your iCloud containers."},{"type":"p","text":"LuxFrame supports exporting complete unencrypted or password-protected AES-GCM encrypted backup files (.luxframebackup), CSV roll journals, GPX tracks, and HTML contact sheets. You have full ownership and control over exported files."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. In-App Purchases and Billing"},{"type":"p","text":"LuxFrame Pro purchases and subscriptions are handled via Apple’s official StoreKit framework. Transactions occur securely between your device and the App Store. The developer never receives or stores payment card information, billing addresses, or Apple ID credentials."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Retention, Data Erasure, and Revocation"},{"type":"p","text":"Your film rolls and gear profiles remain on your device until you manually delete specific frames, entire rolls, or select \"Erase All Data\" in Settings. Deleting the app removes all data and caches stored in the local sandbox."},{"type":"p","text":"You can revoke camera, microphone, location, or photo permissions anytime in iOS Settings > LuxFrame. Revoking permissions only disables the corresponding tool, while offline calculations and roll notes remain fully functional."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. Policy Updates and Inquiries"},{"type":"p","text":"Any updates to our privacy practices will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date. For privacy inquiries or feature requests, contact: zipmaster_support@126.com."}]},"pastepipe":{"zh-Hans":[{"type":"h1","text":"PastePipe 隐私政策"},{"type":"p","text":"生效日期：2026 年 10 月 28 日"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe 是一款专为 Mac 设计的剪贴板历史管理、文本清洗管道与屏幕文字识别工具。本隐私政策说明 PastePipe 在您使用剪贴板记录、快捷短语、文本管道、屏幕 OCR、iCloud 同步以及技术支持时，如何收集、使用与保护您的信息。"},{"type":"p","text":"简要原则：PastePipe 坚持端侧运算与本地优先（Local-First）。应用无需注册账户，不设开发者运营的数据收集服务器，不包含任何第三方数据分析或广告追踪 SDK。您的剪贴板数据与个人隐私始终由您完全掌控。"},{"type":"h2","text":"1. 剪贴板历史与数据存储"},{"type":"p","text":"在您复制文本、富文本（RTF/HTML）、图像、色彩或文件路径时，PastePipe 会在您的 Mac 本机捕获并建立索引，以便您通过快捷键（如 ⌘⇧V）快速回溯与搜索。"},{"type":"p","text":"本地强加密：所有本地保存的历史记录、收藏片段、分类标签和自定义工作流均使用 AES-GCM 高强度加密算法存储在本地沙盒数据库中，其加密密钥由 macOS 钥匙串（Keychain）安全生成并保管。除您授权的系统服务外，其他应用无法读取该密钥。"},{"type":"h2","text":"2. 密码管理器与敏感机密过滤"},{"type":"p","text":"为保障账户凭据安全，PastePipe 开箱即对已知密码管理器（包括 1Password、Bitwarden、KeePassXC 以及 Apple 官方密码与钥匙串访问）采取默认过滤机制，不记录这些应用复制的临时凭据。"},{"type":"p","text":"端侧机密内容过滤：应用内置启发式安全检测器，在保存剪贴板内容前于端侧扫描文本。若检测到疑似 API 密钥、私钥、OAuth 令牌或强随机密码模式，将自动跳过保存。此检测纯在端侧完成，且可于偏好设置中灵活调整。"},{"type":"h2","text":"3. 屏幕与图片文字识别（OCR）"},{"type":"p","text":"当您使用屏幕识字快捷键（默认 ⌘⇧2）框选屏幕区域，或对复制的图片执行文字提取时，PastePipe 调用 macOS 原生 Apple Vision 框架在设备芯片上离线进行文字识别与二维码解析。"},{"type":"p","text":"整个识别流程 100% 在 Mac 本机运算完成，图像像素与识别出的文字绝不会上传至任何远程服务器或云端 API。"},{"type":"h2","text":"4. macOS 系统权限说明"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe 严格遵循最小权限原则，核心剪贴板复制取用与文本管道转换无需任何特殊系统权限："},{"type":"li","text":"屏幕录制权限（Screen Recording）：仅在您主动按下 ⌘⇧2 触发屏幕框选取词时，由系统请求该权限用于捕获您框选的局部矩形图像。PastePipe 从不进行后台持续录屏或音频监听。"},{"type":"li","text":"辅助功能权限（Accessibility）：此权限完全为可选。仅当您在设置中明确启用了“直接粘贴到上一个应用”时需要，以便在您选择历史项后模拟 ⌘V 击键完成直接插入。若不开启此权限，按回车仅复制到系统剪贴板，核心体验不受影响。"},{"type":"h2","text":"5. 可选的私有 iCloud 同步（Pro 功能）"},{"type":"p","text":"iCloud 同步默认为关闭状态。若您主动开启，PastePipe 通过 Apple CloudKit 框架仅将文本历史记录和代码片段同步到与您 Apple 账户绑定的私有数据库中。"},{"type":"p","text":"同步通道由 Apple 负责全程传输加密与身份验证，开发者无权访问您的 iCloud 容器。为节省带宽并确保私密性，大尺寸图片、富文本附件、文件引用和 OCR 识别结果始终保留在当前 Mac 本地，不执行云端同步。您可随时在设置中一键暂停或停止同步。"},{"type":"h2","text":"6. 开发者工具集成（MCP 与快捷指令）"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe 提供只读的 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 接口及 macOS 快捷指令（Shortcuts）操作，方便您在本地构建 AI 工作流或自动化脚本。这些接口仅在本地按需调用，不会对外监听或修改您的系统剪贴板，且输出时默认对敏感特征进行脱敏处理。"},{"type":"h2","text":"7. App Store 购买与订阅"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe Pro 的年订阅或终身买断购买完全通过 Apple StoreKit 官方框架与 App Store 通信。开发者不收集、处理或存储任何银行卡号、账单地址或 Apple 账户密码。"},{"type":"h2","text":"8. 数据保留、导出与彻底删除"},{"type":"p","text":"您对自己的数据拥有最高控制权：您可以在应用中逐条删除历史、批量清空列表、清除特定标签或重置全部设置。若您卸载 PastePipe 并移除其沙盒容器，所有本地加密数据和偏好设置将被彻底销毁。若开启了 iCloud 同步，在应用内清空项目也会同步从私有 CloudKit 中删除对应记录。"},{"type":"h2","text":"9. 儿童隐私与政策变更"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe 是面向大众的 macOS 效率工具，不针对 13 岁以下儿童收集个人信息。若我们的数据处理方式发生调整，我们将更新此页面并注明更新日期。"},{"type":"h2","text":"10. 联系我们"},{"type":"p","text":"若您对本隐私政策或 PastePipe 的数据处理有任何疑问、意见或反馈，请通过以下方式联系技术支持团队："},{"type":"p","text":"支持邮箱：zipmaster_support@126.com"}],"en":[{"type":"h1","text":"PastePipe Privacy Policy"},{"type":"p","text":"Effective Date: October 28, 2026"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe is a macOS clipboard history manager, text transformation pipe, and screen OCR tool. This Privacy Policy explains how PastePipe handles your data when you use clipboard capture, snippet templates, text pipes, screen OCR, optional iCloud sync, and customer support."},{"type":"p","text":"Core Principles: PastePipe is local-first by design. The app requires no user accounts, operates no developer cloud database, and includes no third-party analytics or advertising tracking SDKs. You retain full control over your clipboard data."},{"type":"h2","text":"1. Clipboard History and Local Storage"},{"type":"p","text":"When you copy text, rich text (RTF/HTML), images, colors, or file paths, PastePipe indexes them locally on your Mac so you can search and access them via global shortcuts (such as ⌘⇧V)."},{"type":"p","text":"Strong Local Encryption: All locally stored history, saved snippets, tags, and custom workflows are encrypted at rest using AES-GCM. The encryption key is securely generated and kept in the macOS Keychain, inaccessible to unauthorized applications."},{"type":"h2","text":"2. Password Managers & Secrets Filtering"},{"type":"p","text":"To protect sensitive credentials, PastePipe ignores items copied from recognized password managers (such as 1Password, Bitwarden, KeePassXC, and Apple Passwords/Keychain) out of the box."},{"type":"p","text":"On-Device Secrets Filter: An integrated heuristic filter scans text before saving. If patterns matching API keys, private keys, access tokens, or high-entropy passwords are detected, PastePipe automatically skips recording them. This analysis runs strictly on your Mac."},{"type":"h2","text":"3. Screen & Image OCR"},{"type":"p","text":"When you invoke Screen OCR (⌘⇧2) to select a screen area, or extract text from a copied image, PastePipe utilizes Apple native Vision framework on-device to recognize text and QR codes."},{"type":"p","text":"The entire OCR process runs 100% locally on your Mac hardware. Pixels and recognized text are never transmitted to any external server or cloud API."},{"type":"h2","text":"4. macOS System Permissions"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe adheres to the principle of least privilege. Core clipboard access and text transformation pipes require no special system permissions:"},{"type":"li","text":"Screen Recording Permission: Requested only when you press ⌘⇧2 to perform screen OCR. It is used solely to capture the specific rectangle you select. PastePipe never records your screen continuously or monitors audio."},{"type":"li","text":"Accessibility Permission: Completely optional. Required only if you enable Direct Paste in Settings to simulate keystrokes into the target app. Without this permission, pressing Return copies the clip to the clipboard for manual pasting (⌘V), keeping all core functions intact."},{"type":"h2","text":"5. Optional Private iCloud Sync (Pro)"},{"type":"p","text":"iCloud sync is off by default. When explicitly enabled, PastePipe synchronizes text history and snippet boards via Apple CloudKit directly to your personal, private iCloud container."},{"type":"p","text":"Data in transit is encrypted by Apple; developers cannot access your iCloud database. Large images, RTF payloads, file references, and OCR outputs remain on your local Mac. You can disable sync at any time in Settings."},{"type":"h2","text":"6. Developer Integrations (MCP & Shortcuts)"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe offers a read-only Model Context Protocol (MCP) server and Apple Shortcuts actions. These integrations run on-demand locally, do not alter your clipboard, and automatically redact common sensitive patterns."},{"type":"h2","text":"7. In-App Purchases & Subscriptions"},{"type":"p","text":"Purchases for PastePipe Pro (annual subscription or lifetime unlock) are processed through Apple StoreKit and the Mac App Store. The developer does not receive or store any payment information or Apple account credentials."},{"type":"h2","text":"8. Data Retention, Export, and Deletion"},{"type":"p","text":"You can delete individual clips, clear search history, or wipe all records within the app at any time. Uninstalling PastePipe and removing its container directory permanently deletes all local encrypted files. If iCloud sync was active, deleting clips locally propagates deletion to your private CloudKit records."},{"type":"h2","text":"9. Children Privacy & Policy Updates"},{"type":"p","text":"PastePipe does not knowingly collect information from children under 13. If our privacy practices change, updates will be reflected on this page alongside a revised effective date."},{"type":"h2","text":"10. Contact Us"},{"type":"p","text":"If you have questions, suggestions, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to our team at:"},{"type":"p","text":"Email: zipmaster_support@126.com"}]}};
